<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ROM" style="id">- Saafi-Saafi</book>
  <para style="h">Ɓi Rom</para>
  <para style="toc3">Rom</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ɓi Rom</para>
  <para style="toc1">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Rom</para>
  <para style="mt">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Rom</para>
  <para style="is">Rangsohaani</para>
  <para style="ip">Pool ɓaahee ŋ Israayel ci, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:1">Ɓi Rom 11:1</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> A nikee <char style="w"><char style="tl">Farisen</char></char>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 23:6">Tum ci 23:6</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 3:5">Ɓi Filippi 3:5</ref></char></note> Ŋ finho <char style="w">Paantakot</char>, wi Janguuni camb ɓaatuk, a ɓaahee ŋ ɓi tolfiɗee kosiɗ ci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:58-8:3">Tum ci 7:58–8:3</ref></char></note> Waaye wa raakka mbeh, a cohha na Yeesu, a kossa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 9:1-30">Tum ci 9:1-30</ref></char></note> po a nikka <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> sah. Teerndiŋ "Tum ciŋ <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ci" teeɓohiɗ pangkiŋ ɗe wi a nik <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ini kooɗoh ŋ saar 13.</para>
  <para style="ip">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi <char style="w">Rom</char> wii, a fiisa ŋ reehɗohaanaŋ ɓaaɓaŋ ɗe yakka kaahayɗoh,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 18:23-21:17">Tum ci 18:23–21:17</ref></char></note> wa raak ɗe ŋ waas Yerusalem ɓayeeɗa onoh ci a komee kosiɗ ca ñakiɗ ca nik ndaam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 15:25-31">Ɓi Rom 15:25-31</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 16:1-4">1 Korenta 16:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8-9">2 Korenta 8–9</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:10">Ɓi Galaat 2:10</ref></char></note> Ŋ reehɗohaaniŋ teerndi, a woyiɗ kosiɗ ciŋ Rom ne ɓa taambkoh Feebe yi gen Señsare,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 16:1-2">Ɓi Rom 16:1-2</ref></char></note> ineem weɗ teeɓoh ne a Feebe wik kaɓɗohi ngaŋ Rom.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋ kaɓɗohi a fiis wii, a teeɓohiɗ baahiɗ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> findi wa kaɗoh. A nammba teeɓoh mandohaaɗiŋ ɓooɓi na findi ɓa joy mucɗohu, Yawuut na nikaaɗi Yawuut, maanaam yurhaaɗiiki nik ŋ keeñiŋ yaa nu nga. A teeɓohiɗ hooliɗ ne mandohaaɗeem, ali ɓo' minɗi muciɗ haf ce. A teeɓohha ne a Kooh na baahohe ɓo' a on ɗe kiyurah, wa ini a yeyyoo haa, wa taamboh ŋ kos ɗe, waaye ŋ tum in baahiɗ haa. Ŋ mirndaani a namiɗ teeɓoh findi ɓo' min pesoh ŋ kiyurheem.</para>
  <para style="iot">Fiisi Pool kaɓɗoh ɓi Rom kaɗtiɗoh an :</para>
  <para style="io1">- Kañɗoh, maɗ hot ɓi Rom, na ini kaɓɗohi poon <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:1-17">1:1-17</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ali ɓo' yurahɗi ŋ fiki Kooh <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 1:18-3:20">1:18–3:20</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi Kooh na mucɗohohe taamboh ŋ kos <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 3:21-4:25">3:21–4:25</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Kipes ki asi ngaŋ <char style="w">Kiristaa</char> <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 5:1-8:39">5:1–8:39</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Ini Kooh tufkiɗ ne a tumiɗa Israayel ci <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 9-11">9–11</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Findi kosiɗ joy pesoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 12:1-15:13">12:1–15:13</ref></char></para>
  <para style="io1">- Reehɗohaani na kañɗoh ci mirndoh <char style="ior"><ref loc="ROM 15:14-16:27">15:14–16:27</ref></char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ROM 1" />
  <para style="s">Kañɗohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 1:1" />Mi yii kañiɗ ɗu, ɗu ɓi nik ŋ <char style="w">Rom</char>, mi yi Pool, <char style="w" lemma="ñaam">ñaamiŋ</char> <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu. Ŋ ɓeeɗkuuɗ ne ŋ nik <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> te ŋ kooɗuuɗ ne ŋ woo <char style="w" lemma="Yegɗohiŋ Muci">Yegɗohiŋ Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ muci</char>. <verse eid="ROM 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 1:2" />Yegɗoheem, a gapohee wa taamboh ŋ woosuuɗ ci ŋ Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci. <verse eid="ROM 1:2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="ROM 1:3-4" />Wa na woye ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe Yeesu Kiristaa, Heɗ ɓoo ; a puloh ŋ Dawuuda<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3-4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 17:11-14">1 Nguur ci 17:11-14</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 9:5-6">Esayi 9:5-6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 23:5">Yeremi 23:5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:1">Macce 1:1</ref></char></note> ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Adina. Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, a eɗuuɗ hatiliŋ <char style="w">Kuɓkiŋ Kooh</char> wa a hultiɗu.<verse eid="ROM 1:3-4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 1:5" />Taamboh nga ɗe, ŋ baahohuuɗ po ŋ nikka <char style="tl">Apootar</char> ne ɓooɓiŋ cuuɓ ci jen min ɗe kerhiɗ taamboh ŋ kos ; ŋ ineem, tiikiŋ ɗe yak. <verse eid="ROM 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 1:6" />Ɗu, ɗu nam ɓaah ŋ ɓooɓeem, ɗu ɓi Yeesu Kiristaa ɓeeɗuk ŋ haf ce.<verse eid="ROM 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 1:7" />Mi yii fiisiɗ ɗu kaytii, ɗu ɓi nik ŋ Rom jen, ɗu ɓi Kooh keeñkoh te a ɓeeɗukka ɗu ne ɗu hool wuu ce. Kooh Baabiŋ ɓoo baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam ! Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗi baahohaat ɗu, a on ɗu jam !<verse eid="ROM 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool maɗiɗ kaɗ marka kosiɗ caŋ Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 1:8" />Mi yii camboh corkiɗ Koohiŋ ngo taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, sagu kosi ɗu kos, laam weɗi laamtohseeɗa ŋ adinaani jen.<verse eid="ROM 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 1:9" />Kooh seede'iɗ to, Kooh yi mi na pangkiɗe ŋ keeñiŋ ngo ŋ Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Kuɓkiŋ ɗe. A seede'iɗ ne ŋ gen ɗu gen ɓaahndoh ŋ kiim ci mi na kiimee ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 1:10" />Ŋ gen ɗe kiim ne a on ndo mbeh po ŋ min ɗu hay marke, ne a waaɗa ɗah. <verse eid="ROM 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 1:11" />Ŋ waaɗiɗ ɗu hot lool, ne ŋ eɗ ɗu, ɗu min ɓaah na so onoh ci Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani baahoh ho, ne ca ndengiɗ ɗu. <verse eid="ROM 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 1:12" />Ŋ waaɗ woo ne, ŋ hay ndeem ɗah, ɓoo ñaahtiɗoh ŋ kosi ɓoo ɓaah, wiŋ ɗu na wiŋ ngo.<verse eid="ROM 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 1:13" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo kosiɗ ci, ŋ waaɗiɗ ne ɗu inah ne waas laayiɗ ŋ tufkiɗ ne ŋ hay ɗu marke ne nikiŋ ngo na ɗu min rim in findi ŋ tumoha na cuuɓ ci cinooci ; waaye poyi ŋ minɗi wa tum. <verse eid="ROM 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 1:14" />Ŋ yegiɗ ŋ haf fo ne jangiɗ na jangaaɗi etohiɗ pangkiŋ ngo, te ñaañiɗ na ñaañaaɗi etohiɗa. <verse eid="ROM 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 1:15" />Weɗ tah ɗu ɓi Rom, ŋ waaɗta ɗu woo lool Yegɗohiŋ Muci, findi ŋ woyoha ɓinooɓi.<verse eid="ROM 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yegɗohiŋ Muci weɗ Hatiliŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 1:16" />Laam ŋ supukɗi woo Yegɗohiŋ Muci ; Yegɗohiŋ Muci, weɗ hatiliŋ Kooh, weɗ a na mucɗohe yaa nu kos ɗah, wa camboh ŋ Yawuut ci, ɓi nikɗi Yawuut taammba nga. <verse eid="ROM 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 1:17" />Wa na teeɓohe wa ye weɗ kiyurhi puloh ŋ Kooh, te wa jen, wa camboh ŋ kos, wa mirndohha ŋ kos, findi wa fiisohu an : « Yaa nu yurah ɗah, pesohan kosi a kos. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HAB 2:4">Habakuk 2:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayrukiŋ Kooh keen ŋ yurhaaɗiici</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 1:18" />Laam ayrukiŋ Kooh puloh nga ɗe na teeɓohke teeɓohuk, wa keen ŋ ɗafuk ɓooɓi eɗɗi ɗe cir, ɓi yurhaaɗiici, ɓi hondoh keeh ki pul sagu yurhaaɗiikiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 1:19" />Laam, ini min inhu ngaŋ Kooh wa hooliɗ nga ɓa ; a Kooh teeɓoha. <verse eid="ROM 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 1:20" />Ina Adina ferohu poyi, ini minɗi hotu nga ɗe, maanaam hatiliŋ ɗe po faw na kikooh kiŋ ɗe, ɓo' miniɗa inah ŋ in ci Kooh haɓiɗ, ne ɓoyeem liiɓ nga ɗah.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 1:20">Kon, ɓooɓeem raakɗi ali naafkoha, <verse eid="ROM 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 1:21" />laam ali nik ne ɓa inhiɗ Kooh, ɓa yakiɗɗi ɗe findi Kooh, ɓa corkiɗɗi ɗe ; waaye ɓa muuƴiɗ ŋ liiɓsiɗoh ciŋ ɓa, te liiɓ ciŋ ɓa ñaañaaɗiici na ɓekee ɓa ŋ ñuus tuɗ. <verse eid="ROM 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 1:22" />Ɓa na toone ñaañ, waaye ɓa topiɗ naand. <verse eid="ROM 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 1:23" />Joy ne ɓa ñaamuk Kooh, yi Heɗ kiyak, te a minɗi kaan, ɓa ñaamkee nataal ɓo' kaanoh na nataal sel na ɗoopaat heɗ kot nikiis na faskoh.<verse eid="ROM 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 1:24" />Weɗ tah Kooh faɗ ɓa ŋ hoolaaɗiiki keeñ ciŋ ɓa waaɗ, po ŋ harmban ɓa, ɓa riiɓɗee faan ciŋ ɓa na riiɓ kaci'ɗohiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 1:25" />Ɓa na faɗe keeh kiŋ Kooh, ɓa ambee ŋ lee ; te ɓa ñaamkee, ɓa pangkiɗee feruuɗ ci, ɓa sang ñaamuk na pangkiɗ Ferohi, Kooh, yi yakɗaah po faw ! Amiin !<verse eid="ROM 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 1:26" />Tumohaaɗ ceem ceɗ tah, Kooh faɗta ɓa ŋ waaɗ-waaɗ kaci'ɗohiɗ. Ŋ ineem, ɓitiɓ ciŋ ɓa faɗiɗ faankohi moɗoɗi, ɓa faankohee ɓitiɓ na ɓitiɓ. <verse eid="ROM 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 1:27" />Wa nam mand ɗaa ŋ ƴaar ci, ɓa faɗiɗ faankohi moɗoɗi na ɓitiɓ, ɓa maɗtiɗohee keeh-keeh ŋ harmban ɓa. Ɓa na tume in kaci'ɗohiɗ ŋ harmban ɓa, faankoh ƴaar na ƴaar. Ŋ ineem, ɓa rahsee ŋ haf ɓa wirndi ɓa joy rahas ŋ muuƴi ɓa muuƴ.<verse eid="ROM 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 1:28" />Ɓa amb ne inah Kooh raakɗi njiriñ, weɗ tah a faɗ ɓa ŋ liiɓohaaɗ raakaaɗi njiriñ, po ɓa tumee in ci nikɗi waas. <verse eid="ROM 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 1:29" />Ɓa riiffa na in yurhaaɗi nu nik na añaand na waaɗ kopor na tum baahaaɗi. Ɓa riifiɗ na siis na apoh na lahtoh na njuucnjaac na tum moɗaaɗi. Ɓa na ɗooɓohe ɗooɓoh, <verse eid="ROM 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 1:30" />ɓa yahee tiik, ɓa sangiɗ Kooh, ɓa ɓasohoh, ɓa hotsiɗkoh, ɓa tipkoh, ɓa ñaañiɗ ŋ tumoh miskiɗ, ɓa kerhiɗɗi ɓi rim ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 1:31" />Ɓa raakɗi hel, ɓa na tumeeɗi ini ɓa woo, ɓa suussiɗ keeñ, ɓa na miskasseeɗi.<verse eid="ROM 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 1:32" />Ɓa inhiɗ findi Kooh atte'oh in ceem : Ɓi na tume in ceem yeyyoo kaan. Waaye ɓa na tumee ca, ɓaatta nga, ɓa neɓsee ŋ ɓi na namee ca tum.<verse eid="ROM 1:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ROM 2" />
  <para style="s">Atteeniŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 2:1" />Fu, ɓo' nu fu min ki nik ɗah, fu yi na atte'e morom fu, fu raakɗi ali naafkoha. Fu atte'ee morom fu ɗah, fu na atte'e haf fu, laam fu na name tum in ci a na tume. <verse eid="ROM 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 2:2" />Te kat, ɓoo inhiɗ ne atteeniŋ Kooh ŋ ɓi na tume in mand na ceem gaƴuk ŋ keeh.<verse eid="ROM 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 2:3" />Fu yi na atte'e ɓi na tume in ceem, te fu yii nam ca tum, fu liiɓiɗ ne fu hey fuse ŋ atteeniŋ Kooh e ? <verse eid="ROM 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 2:4" />Wala fu heef heef yaki baah kiŋ ɗe yak, na muñiŋ ɗe, na min sek kiŋ ɗe ? Te fu hotɗi hotɗi ne baah kiŋ Kooh joyiɗ ɗa ɓay ŋ ɓoƴsoh tumohaaɗ e ? <verse eid="ROM 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 2:5" />Ndengi fu ndeng haf na sangi fu sang ɓoƴsoh ŋ keeñiŋ ɗa, tahiɗ po fu na nangɗohe ayruk yakiɗ wuu mbehiŋ ayruki. Mbeheem, atteeni yurhiɗi hey inhasse, atteeniŋ Kooh.<verse eid="ROM 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 2:6" />Ŋ mbeheem, a hey wirnde yaa nu nga ɗah tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 2:7" />Ɓi na gene tum in baahiɗ, ɓa waakohee wa ndam na cir na kaanaaɗi, Kooh na sekɗohee ɓa kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="ROM 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 2:8" />Waaye ɓi na sange keeh ki te ɓa taambɗee yurhaaɗi sagu waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɓa haf ɓa, Kooh na sekɗohee ɓa ayruk keeh-keeh.<verse eid="ROM 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 2:9" />Ee, miskiɗ na keeñ reehiɗ, caɗ na seke ɓo' nu na tume moɗaaɗi ɗah, ineem cambohan ŋ Yawuut ci, ɓi nikɗi Yawuut taamb nga. <verse eid="ROM 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 2:10" />Waaye ndam na cir na jam ca wuu ɓi na tume baahiɗ, ineem cambohan ŋ Yawuut ci, ɓi nikɗi Yawuut taamb nga. <verse eid="ROM 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 2:11" />Laam Kooh talsohɗi ali ɓo'. <verse eid="ROM 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 2:12" />Ɓi bakaaɗ jen te ɓa inahɗi nakoh ciŋ <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char>, ɓa hey atte'se ŋ ini nikɗi waasiŋ Musaa, ɓa sooƴ. Ɓi bakaaɗ jen te ɓa inahha waasiŋ Musaa, ɓa hey atte'se ŋ waasiŋ Musaa. <verse eid="ROM 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 2:13" />Laam wa nikɗi haa ne ɓi na sikɗuke waasi ɓeɗ yurah ŋ fiki Kooh ; waaye e ɓi na taambɗe waasi ɓeɗ na hee ambse findi yurhiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 2:14" />Ɓi nikɗi Yawuut te ɓa rahasɗi waasiŋ Musaa, nik ne ɓa na tume ini fiisu ŋ waasi sagu yegi ɓa yeg ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ ciŋ ɓa ne wa ɗaa ɗah, ɓeɗ ɓeem, ali ɓa raakɗi waasi, ineem weɗ waasiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 2:15" />Ɓa na teeɓohe ne ini waasi nakoh, wa fiisu ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓa. Liiɓ ɓo' namiɗ teeɓoh ineem, ŋ ini wa na yambee ɗe, wala langɗee ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 2:16" />Te wa mandan ɗaa ŋ mbehi Kooh atte'ohan in ci ɗasɗukiɗ ciŋ ɓooɓi, taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu, findi wa woyohu ŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char> mi na yegɗohe.<verse eid="ROM 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waasiŋ Musaa na nguɗkiŋ Yawuut ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 2:17" />Fu yi woo ne fu Yawuut, fu gaƴukka ŋ waasiŋ Musaa, fu ndamkohee Kooh, <verse eid="ROM 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 2:18" />fu inhiɗ ini a waaɗ, te waasi jangɗiɗ ɗa po fu minnda inhisoh in ci baah. <verse eid="ROM 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 2:19" />Fu liiɓ ne fu miniɗ nook fuuliɗ ci, fu niitɗee ɓi nik ŋ ñuus, <verse eid="ROM 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 2:20" />fu koɗee naandiɗ ci, fu jangɗee inhaaɗiici, laam wa wooriɗ nga ɗa ne fu raakiɗ ŋ waasiŋ Musaa ki'inah na keeh mitiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 2:21" />Fu yi na jangɗe ɓinooɓi, fu jangɗanɗi haf fu e ? Fu yi na woye ne ɓo' joyɗi rok, te fu roke ! <verse eid="ROM 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 2:22" />Fu yi na woye ne ɓo' joyɗi njaaloo, te fu njaalo'e ! Fu yi na araamɗe kooh ci nikaaɗiici, wa ye tah fu roke in ciŋ ca ? <verse eid="ROM 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 2:23" />Fu yi na ndamkohe waasi te fu tumee ini wa sangoh, fu na riiɓɗe tiikiŋ Kooh ! <verse eid="ROM 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 2:24" />Findi Fiis ci woyoha an : « E ɗu tah cuuɓ ci cinooci ɓasee Kooh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:5">Esayi 52:5</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 2:25" />Fu Yawuut e ? Fu <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗkiɗ</char> e ? Nguɗkeem raakiɗ njiriñ ne fu pesoh waasiŋ Musaa ɗah ; waaye nik ne fu kerhiɗɗi waasi ɗah, nguɗkiŋ ɗa mand na nguɗkaaɗi. <verse eid="ROM 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 2:26" />Ɓoyi nikɗi Yawuut, a na nguɗkeeɗi findi waasiŋ Musaa woyoha. Ɓoyeem, a taambiɗ in ci waasi nakoh ɗah, Kooh amban ɗe findi nguɗkiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 2:27" />Nguɗkaaɗiineem, yi na taambɗe ini waasi nakoh, a teeɓohanɗi ne fu nikɗi ŋ keeh e, fu yi nguɗuk waaye fu kerhiɗɗi waasi te raak ɗa na Fiis ci ?<verse eid="ROM 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 2:28" />Yawuut keeh-keeh, wa ini na hotke ŋ ɓoyi haa ; te nguɗuk keeh-keeh weɗ ini na hotke ŋ faani haa. <verse eid="ROM 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 2:29" />Yawuut keeh-keeh a yi ɓoyi nika ŋ ɗooƴ ce ; nguɗuk keeh-keeh, wa na nike ŋ keeñ, wa puloh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, wa pulohɗi ŋ taambiɗ nakoh ci fiisu ; te ɓoyi nika, e ɓooɓi na ɗaapee ɗa haa, e Kooh ŋ haf ce.<verse eid="ROM 2:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ROM 3" />
  <para style="s">Kooh na faɗeeɗi ambtiɗohiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 3:1" />Nik ne wa ɗaa ɗah, Yawuut uupɗoh ɓinooɓi ye, wala wa ye weɗ njirñiŋ <char style="w">nguɗuk</char> ? <verse eid="ROM 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 3:2" />Ca laayiɗ, ŋ in nu nik ! Wi koc nga, Yawuut ci ɓeɗ dengkohu yegɗoh ciŋ Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 3:3" />Nik ne raakiɗ ɓi ɓo' nga, ɓi ambɗi ambtiɗohiŋ ɓa na Kooh ɗah, ineem min min hondoh Kooh amb ambtiɗohiŋ ɗe e ? <verse eid="ROM 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 3:4" />Muk ! Ɓoo kay teyɗukaat ne Kooh woyoh keeh te ɓooɓi jen nikka leyoh, findi wa fiisohu an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">« Ŋ ineem, Kooh,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">kiyurhiŋ ɗa hey hotke</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">ŋ woo ciŋ ɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">te ŋ ngel ciŋ ɗa jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:4">yaf ɓuran. <note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 51:6">Sabuur 51:6</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 3:5" />Ŋ ndii, mi na woye findi ɓum na woyohe, ɓa na woye ne : « E yurhaaɗiikiŋ ɓoo weɗ na teeɓohe yurhiŋ Kooh. Kon a ruhsiɗ ayrukiŋ ɗe nga ɓoo ɗah, a tumɗi ini lah waas. » <verse eid="ROM 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 3:6" />An ɓa woo ne Kooh tumɗi ini lah waas i ? Muk, ineem minɗi nik ! Kon, a minohan atte Adina na ? <verse eid="ROM 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 3:7" />Waaye nik ne ley ɓo' na teeɓohe keeh kiŋ Kooh, wa ɓaatee yaki a yak ɗah, wee tah ɓo' atte'see findi bakaaɗoh poyi ?<verse eid="ROM 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 3:8" />Kon wee tah ɓoo tumanɗi baahaaɗi ne wa rim in baahiɗ ? Raakiɗ sah ɓi na ɓase ɓoo, ɓa woyee ne weɗ ɓoo na woye ! Ɓooɓeem, atteeni Kooh atte'an ɓa, weɗ ɓa yeyyoo.<verse eid="ROM 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ali ɓo' yurahɗi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 3:9" />An ye ? E ɓoo ngisoh ɓinooɓi e ? Muk ! Laam ŋ teeɓohiɗ po ƴutiɗ ne Yawuut na nikaaɗi Yawuut jen, e bakaaɗ yilif ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 3:10" />Fiis ci woyiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">« Yurhiɗ raakɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:10">ali yino sah ;<verse eid="ROM 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 3:11" />ali ɓo' ñaañɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:11">ali ɓo' waakɗi Kooh.<verse eid="ROM 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 3:12" />E ɓooɓi jen faɗ waasi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">ɓeɗ hun ɓa mbalaye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">raakɗi yi na tume baahiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:12">yino dong sah raakɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 14:1-3">Sabuur 14:1-3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 53:2-4">53:2-4</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 3:13" />« Nguɓ ciŋ ɓa ruy-ruy kunsuuɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">ɓa na ñaañohohe peɗeem ciŋ ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 5:10">Sabuur 5:10</ref></char></note> »</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">« Njootoot ciŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:13">na pulɗe daŋar iiñ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 140:4">Sabuur 140:4</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 3:14" />« Nguɓ ciŋ ɓa riifiɗ na kiimiɗ ɓo' alku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:14">te wa na hune na aay keeñ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 10:7">Sabuur 10:7</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 3:15" />« Kot ciŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:15">gaawiɗ ŋ kaɗ aama ñif.<verse eid="ROM 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 3:16" />Ɗisik nu ɓa lah ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:16">yahroh na naamo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:16">ceɗ ɓa na faɗe nga.<verse eid="ROM 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 3:17" />Ɓa inahɗi waas jam.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 59:7-8">Esayi 59:7-8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 1:16">Gonaah ci 1:16</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 3:18" />« Nup Kooh nikɗi nga ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 3:18">ɓa liiɓɗaa sah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 36:2">Sabuur 36:2</ref> </char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 3:19" />Te ɓoo inhiɗ ne Fiis ciŋ waasi, ca jen, ca na woye na ɓi waasi yilif, ne ɓooɓi jen ɗek, te Adina jen ɓuru ŋ fiki Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 3:20" />Kon ali ɓo' na ambseeɗi findi yurhiɗ ŋ tum in ci waasi nakoh. Waasi kay, wa na rime inah bakaaɗ.<verse eid="ROM 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiyurhi Kooh onoh te wa taambohɗi ŋ nakoh ciŋ waasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 3:21" />Waaye ɗiski wa nik, Kooh teeɓohiɗ findi a na onohe ɓo' kiyurah, te wa taambohanɗi ŋ nakoh ciŋ waasi, waaye teereeciŋ waasi na woosuuɗ ci ndengiɗ ndengiɗ ineem. <verse eid="ROM 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 3:22" />Kiyurheem, Kooh onoha taamboh ŋ kos Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>. Wa ɗaa ŋ ɓooɓi kos jen, wa raakɗi talsoh ; <verse eid="ROM 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 3:23" />ɓooɓi jen ɓeɗ bakaaɗ, tahha po ɓa ñakiɗ kiyak ki puloh ŋ Kooh ; <verse eid="ROM 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 3:24" />waaye a baahohiɗ ɓa, a onnda ɓa kiyurah, taamboh ŋ mucɗi Kiristaani Yeesu muciɗ ɓa.<verse eid="ROM 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25-26" style="v" sid="ROM 3:25-26" />Kooh eɗoh Kiristaani giifɗoha ayrukiŋ ɗe taamboh ŋ kosi, taamboh ŋ ñif miŋ ɗe aamu ; Kooh haɓɗiɗ ineem ne a teeɓoh kiyurhiŋ ɗe ŋ muñi a muñee bakaaɗ ca ɗeɓgaan, a ɗaasohha ca. A namiɗ teeɓoh kiyurhiŋ ɗe ŋ jamanoonii : Kooh ris yurhiɗ, ali a onoh kiyurah taamboh ŋ kos Yeesu Kiristaa.<verse eid="ROM 3:25-26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 3:27" />Kon, ɓo' na hee ndamkohe ye ? Ali tus ! Wee tah ali tus ? A waasi nakoh tumohaaɗ ci tah e ? A'aa, waaye a waasi nakoh kos tah. <verse eid="ROM 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 3:28" />Laam ɓoo amb ne e kos na tahe ɓo' onu kiyurah, e tumohaaɗ ci waasi nakoh haa.<verse eid="ROM 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 3:29" />Wala Kooh a Koohiŋ Yawuut ci dong e ? A namɗi nik Koohiŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut e ? Ee di', a nam nik Koohiŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut. <verse eid="ROM 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 3:30" />Nik ne wa keeh ne a Kooh yino dong raak ɗah, a yi onan <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗkiɗ</char> ci kiyurah sagu kos, a yi naman on nguɗkaaɗiici kiyurah sagu koseem.<verse eid="ROM 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 3:31" />Andi ineem tokis ne, ɓoo taamboh ŋ kos, nihissa <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> ? Muk ! Ɓoo kay, ɓoo na ndengɗe ini a fiis.<verse eid="ROM 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ROM 4" />
  <para style="s">Kiyurhiŋ Ibrahiima taamboh ŋ kosi a kos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 4:1" />Ɓoo kooɗaat misaal ŋ caac ɓoo Ibrahiima. Ɓoo na hee ye woye nga ɗe ? A raak ye ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe ? <verse eid="ROM 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 4:2" />Nik ne Ibrahiima ambuuɗ ɓo' yurhiɗ sagu tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe ɗah, a raakiɗ ndamkaah. Waaye ŋ fiki Kooh wa kaɗohɗi ɗaa ; <verse eid="ROM 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 4:3" />ŋ ineem Fiis ci woo ye nga ? Ca woo ne : « Ibrahiima kossa Kooh, tahha po Kooh ammba ɗe ɓo' yurhiɗ. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Camba 15:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 4:4" />Ɓoyi na pangke, wirndiŋ ɗe na ambseeɗi findi onohi a baahohu, wa ini joy nik. <verse eid="ROM 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 4:5" />Kooh na one on ɓi sang ɗe kiyurah. Kon, ɓoyi pangukɗi, maanaam, yi tumɗi nakoh ciŋ waasi, te a kos Kooh, Kooh hey marke ŋ kosiŋ ɗe, a amb ɗe findi yurhiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 4:6" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ineem, Dawuuda namiɗ woo neɓiɗiŋ yi Kooh amb findi yurhiɗ te wa gaƴukɗi ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɗe. An :<verse eid="ROM 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 4:7" />« Ɓa neɓɗiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">ɓi fu inah ne ɓa ɗaasuuɗ moɗaaɗiiciŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:7">te bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa moosuuɗ !<verse eid="ROM 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 4:8" />A neɓɗiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 4:8">ɓoyi Heɗi ambiɗɗi bakaaɗ ciŋ ɗe ! »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 32:1-2">Sabuur 32:1-2</ref></char></note><verse eid="ROM 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 4:9" />Neɓɗeem wa wuu <char style="w" lemma="nguɗuk">nguɗkiɗ</char> ci dong wala nguɗkaaɗiici ɓaah nga ? Ɓoo na woye ne kosi Ibrahiima kos, weɗ tah po Kooh ammba ɗe ɓo' yurhiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 4:10" />A ambu ɓo' yurhiɗ kiɗa ? Ŋ finho nguɗkaŋ ɗe wala bala a nguɗkan ɗah ? Wa raak ɗe nguɗukɗi paaɗ, waam, a nikee nguɗkaaɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Camba 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:10-26">17:10-26</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 4:11" />Kon a rahas mandargaaniŋ nguɗki findi ini teeɓoh kiyurhi a raake. Kiyurheem, a raaka sagu kosi a kosee bala a nguɗkan. Ŋ ineem a miniɗ nik caaciŋ kosiɗ ci nguɗukɗi jen, ne ɓa nam ambu findi ɓo' yurhiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 4:12" />A namiɗ nik caaciŋ nguɗkiɗ ci, nik ne nguɗkiŋ ɓa nguɗuk dong haa, waaye wa hun na taambiɗ kot ciŋ caac ɓoo Ibrahiima ŋ kosi a kose, kot ci a tiindee wa a nguɗukɗi paaɗ.<verse eid="ROM 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gapohi Kooh eɗohan sagu kos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 4:13" />Taambiɗ waas tahɗi po Kooh gappa Ibrahiima na ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe ne ɓeɗ raakan Adina, a kiyurhi puloh ŋ kos tah. <verse eid="ROM 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 4:14" />Nik ne ɓi na taambɗe nakoh ciŋ waasi, ɓeɗ rahsan ini Kooh gapoh ɗah, teemb ndeem, kos na raakisseeɗi njiriñ, gapohi jaar nik ɓarang ɓarang. <verse eid="ROM 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 4:15" />Waasi, wa ɓay ayrukiŋ Kooh, te ɗiski waas raakɗi, ɗal waas namɗi raak nga.<verse eid="ROM 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 4:16" />Weɗ tah ɓi na rahse gapohi, ɓa na rahsee wa taamboh ŋ kos, ne wa nik baahoh dong, ne gapohi min nik in wooriɗ wuu ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima jen. Gapoheem topɗi ŋ ɓi rahas waasi, waaye wa nam nik wuu ɓi kos findi Ibrahiima, yi caaciŋ ɓoo jen, <verse eid="ROM 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 4:17" />findi wa fiisohu an : « Ŋ tumiɗ ɗa caaciŋ ɓi cuuɓ laayiɗ. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 17:5">Camba 17:5</ref></char></note> Te weɗ a nik ŋ fiki Kooh yi a kos, yi na pesɗe kaaniɗ ci te a ɓeeɗkee ini nikɗi, jaar wa nik.<verse eid="ROM 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 4:18" />Ɗiski ɓo' foogɗi yaakaar, Ibrahiima raakka yaakaar nga, a kossa ini Kooh gapee ɗe, a nikka caaciŋ ɓi cuuɓ laayiɗ, findi a woyohsee wa an : « Ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa hendan ɗaa. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:5">Camba 15:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 4:19" />A hoteen ne faaniŋ ɗe kaaniɗ po ƴutiɗ, waam raak ɗe raakiɗ ini reɓ kiis teemet - te a hotta ne rookiŋ Saarata kaaneen ŋ raak kuɓu, waaye ineem tahɗi po kosiŋ ɗe haawsukka. <verse eid="ROM 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 4:20" />Wa yahrohɗi in ŋ kosiŋ ɗe po a kee raaka liiɓ kanak ŋ gapohiŋ Kooh, waaye kay, a ɓaat ɓaat raak hatil ŋ kosi a kos, a yakiɗta Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 4:21" />A inheen hooliɗ ne Kooh raakiɗ hatili a tumohan ini a gapoh.<verse eid="ROM 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22-23" style="v" sid="ROM 4:22-23" />Kon a ineem weɗ tah a ammba ɗe findi ɓo' yurhiɗ, te wa fiisuusa. Waaye a yi dong tah po wa fiisuusa haa. <verse eid="ROM 4:22-23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 4:24" />E ɓoo nam tah, ɓoo ɓi Kooh na hee ambe findi ɓo' yurhiɗ, ɓoo ɓi kos Kooh yi hultiɗ Yeesu Heɗ ɓoo. <verse eid="ROM 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 4:25" />Yeesu yeem eɗohuuɗ ne a kaan wuu bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓoo, a hultiɗuusa ne ɓoo rahas kiyurah.<verse eid="ROM 4:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ROM 5" />
  <para style="s">Kerhiɗoh na Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 5:1" />Kon, ɓoo onuuɗ kiyurah taamboh ŋ kosi ɓoo kos, weɗ tah ɓoo raakiɗ jam na Kooh taamboh ŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>. <verse eid="ROM 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 5:2" />A yi nam tah po, taamboh ŋ kos, ɓoo minnda rahas baahohi ɓoo na pesohe, wi on ɓoo po ɓoo minnda tufuk ndengiɗ ŋ kosi ɓoo kos, te ɓoo oolkiɗ ne, ɓoo hey raake ɓak ŋ yaki Kooh yak, te weɗ ɓoo na ndamkohe.<verse eid="ROM 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 5:3" />Ɓaatta nga, ɓoo na ndamkohe miskiɗ ci na rahse ɓoo, laam ɓoo inhiɗ ne miskiɗ na rime muñ. <verse eid="ROM 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 5:4" />Muñ na rime raak ngor te raak ngor na rime ooluk in ci na haye. <verse eid="ROM 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 5:5" />Te oolkeem na kaci'ɗoheeɗi, laam Kooh tumiɗ waaɗohiŋ ɗe ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɓoo po ca riifiɗ tem, taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> ɓoo eɗu.<verse eid="ROM 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 5:6" />Laam, wa ɓoo raakohɗi moocohaaɗ, Kiristaani kaaniɗ wuu sangiɗ ciŋ Kooh ŋ jamanooniŋ wa. <verse eid="ROM 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 5:7" />Wa yooɓɗi ne ɓo' teyɗuk kaan sagu ɓo' yurhiɗ ; heeƴ na wa miniɗ nik ne ɓo' teyɗukiɗ kaan wuu ɓo' baahiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 5:8" />Waaye Kooh teeɓohiɗ waaɗi a waaɗ ɓoo ŋ ini Kiristaani kaan wuu ɓoo wa ɓoo nik bakaaɗoh.<verse eid="ROM 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 5:9" />Te ɗiski wa nik, ɓoo nikisɗi bakaaɗoh, ɓoo onuuɗ kiyurah taamboh ŋ ñif miŋ ɗe aamu, kon wa wooriɗ ne ɓoo hey mucɗasse ŋ ayrukiŋ Kooh ! <verse eid="ROM 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 5:10" />Laam, wa ɓoo nik sangiɗ ciŋ ɗe, ɓoo kerhiɗohɗuuɗ na Kooh taamboh ŋ kakaan kiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char>, mbaa ɓoo kerhiɗohɗuuɗ ɗah, wa wooriɗ ne ɓoo hey mucɗasse taamboh ŋ kipes kiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 5:11" />Te wa topɗi ndeem, ɓoo na name ndamkoh Kooh taamboh ŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa, yi kerhiɗohiɗ ɓoo na ɗe kotii.<verse eid="ROM 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aadama na Yeesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 5:12" />E ɓo' yino ɓek bakaaɗ ŋ Adina, kakaan taambohha ŋ bakaaɗ, hayya, po wa reyiɗ ŋ ɓooɓi jen, laam ɓooɓi jen ɓeɗ bakaaɗ.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3">Camba 3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 5:13" />Bala <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> hayan ɗah, bakaaɗ nikee ŋ Adina, waaye Kooh na ambeeɗi bakaaɗ ne waas raakɗi ɗah. <verse eid="ROM 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 5:14" />Moona, ini kooɗoh ŋ Aadama po ŋ Musaa, kakaan nguurkee ŋ Adina, ali nik ne ɓooɓaŋ jamanoonaam bakaaɗeeɗi sah findi Aadama yi tum ini Kooh sangohee ɗe. Aadama nikee ñaamaariŋ Yi hayee ŋ in laayiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 5:15" />Waaye, ali nik ne Aadama na Yeesu, yi joyee hay, ɓeɗ mand, in ci ɓa tum ɗalohiɗ keeh-keeh. Ini tah po ɓo' laayiɗ kaannda, wa nikee ini ɓo' yino tum, a nikka Aadama, a ɗal waas, waas yino rek, wa ɓayya kakaan. Waaye wa wooriɗ ne, Kooh waaɗ tos ɓooɓi ɗah, onohi a na hee onohe hey uupe yak fuuf yahi Aadama yah. Te Kooh tumiɗ ineem. Ini tah po ɓo' laayiɗ tosuusa, wa nam nik ini ɓo' yino tum, a nikka Yeesu Kiristaa. Wa nikka onohi Kooh baahoh ɓooɓi.<verse eid="ROM 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 5:16" />Ee, ini tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa rim, ɗalohiɗ keeh-keeh. Aadama, a tum bakaaɗ yino dong, atteeniŋ wa mirndohha nik kakaan kiŋ ɓooɓi jen. Waaye ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu, ali nik ne ɗal-waas ci laayiɗ, a tum in yurhiɗ yino dong, wa onnda ɓooɓi kiyurah. <verse eid="ROM 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 5:17" />Ee di' ! E ɗali ɓo' yino ɗal waas tah po kakaan wa ɗii nguuruk ŋ Adina. Waaye kiyurhi Kooh baahoh ɓooɓi, weɗ uup yak ini tumohaaɗiŋ Aadama rim. Ineem weɗ tah wa wooriɗ ne ɓooɓi rahas kiyurheem, ɓa hey raake kipes ki heyɗi reehe, te ɓa hey nguurke sagu ini ɓo' yino dong haɓiɗ, a nikka Yeesu Kiristaa.<verse eid="ROM 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 5:18" />Mbaa, e ɓo' yino dong ɗal waas, jaarra ɓooɓi jen atte'uusa kakaan. Wa mand ɗaa, e ɓo' yino dong nam tum tumohaaɗ yurhiɗ yino, jaarra kiyurhi na onohe kipes reesa ŋ ɓooɓi jen. <verse eid="ROM 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 5:19" />Findi ɓo' yino sangoh kerhiɗ Kooh, tahha po ɓo' laayiɗ tumuusa bakaaɗoh, ɓo' yino kerhiɗoh Kooh ɗaa, tahha po ɓo' laayiɗ hey tumse ɓo' yurhiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 5:20" />Waasi hayiɗ ne ɗal ci na ɗalse waas ɓaatuk, waaye ɗiski bakaaɗ ci ɓaatkoh, baahohi uup nga ɓaatuk fuuf, <verse eid="ROM 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 5:21" />ne, findi bakaaɗ nguurkohee ŋ nguuriŋ kakaan, baahoh nguurkoh ɗaa taamboh ŋ kiyurah ne wa ɓay ɓoo ŋ kipes ki heyɗi reehe taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa Heɗ ɓoo.<verse eid="ROM 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ROM 6" />
  <para style="s">Kaan na Yeesu, pes na ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 6:1" />Kon, ɓoo woyan na book ? Ɓoo risaat bakaaɗ ne Kooh uup ɓoo baahoh e ? <verse eid="ROM 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 6:2" />Muk ! Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ bakaaɗ, ɓoo kaaniɗ, ɓoo min na pesis ŋ bakaaɗ ?<verse eid="ROM 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 6:3" />Ɓoo ɓi hooƴu ŋ masmiŋ ɓokti, ɓoo nikka yino na <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu jen, ɗu inahɗi ne ɓoo ɓoktu ne kakaan kiŋ ɗe nam nik wiŋ ɓoo e ? <verse eid="ROM 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 6:4" />Ŋ ɓoktuki ŋ kakaan keem, ɓoo namiɗ uumbu na ɗe ne, findi a hultoh taamboh ŋ yaki Baabi yak, ɓoo nam hultoh ɗaa, pesee pesohaaɗ as. <verse eid="ROM 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 6:5" />Laam nik ne ɓoo ɓaahiɗ na ɗe kakaan ŋ ɓokti ɓoo ɓoktu ɗah, ɓoo hey name hulit na ɗe, ɓoo ɓaah kipes.<verse eid="ROM 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 6:6" />Ɓoo inhaat inii : Ɓoo nikee ɓo' wiiriis ɗeɓgaan, ɓoyi ɓoo nikee daaƴuuɗ na Yeesu ŋ kurwaa ne ini nikee bakaaɗ ŋ ɗooƴ ɓoo reehɗu po ɓoo nikissuu <char style="w">ñaam</char> bakaaɗ. <verse eid="ROM 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 6:7" />Laam yi kaan, bakaaɗ yilfisɗi ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 6:8" />Nik ne ɓoo kaaniɗ na Kiristaani ɗah, ɓoo hey name pes na ɗe, ineem weɗ ɓoo kos. <verse eid="ROM 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 6:9" />Ɓoo inhiɗ ne Kiristaani hultiɗ po a kaanissanɗi, kakaan minɗisɗi ɗe ali in. <verse eid="ROM 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 6:10" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kakaan kiŋ ɗe, a kaaniɗ waas yino po faw te a rahsohisɗi ali in na bakaaɗ ; ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kipes kiŋ ɗe, a na pese wuu Kooh.<verse eid="ROM 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 6:11" />Wa mand ɗaa nga ɗu, ambaat ne ɗu kaaniɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ bakaaɗ te ɗu ɓii pes wuu Kooh ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu. <verse eid="ROM 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 6:12" />Mbaa ɗah, bakaaɗ joyɗi yilif faaniŋ ɗu joy kaan, po ɗu kerhiɗee maɗ-maɗ ciŋ wa baahaaɗiici. <verse eid="ROM 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 6:13" />Kinaat faɗ cir ciŋ faan ciŋ ɗu po bakaaɗ kee ca tuma ganaay tumoha in yurhaaɗi. Waaye eɗaat haf ɗu Kooh findi pesoh ci kaane, te ɗu eɗ Kooh cir ciŋ faan ciŋ ɗu findi ganaay tumoha in yurhiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 6:14" />Bakaaɗ heyɗi ɗu yilfe, laam waasi yilifɗi ɗu, e baahohiŋ Kooh kilifaaniŋ ɗu.<verse eid="ROM 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Faɗ bakaaɗ, teyɗuk nik ñaamiŋ kiyurah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 6:15" />An ye ? Ini waasi yilifɗi ɓoo, baahohiŋ Kooh nikka kilifaaniŋ ɓoo, ineem joyiɗ tah ɓoo pesee ŋ bakaaɗ e ? Muk ! <verse eid="ROM 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 6:16" />Ɗu inhiɗ ne ɗu eɗ ɓo' haf ɗu ne ɗu nik ñaamiŋ ɗe te ɗu kerhiɗ ɗe ɗah, ɗu ñaamiŋ ɗe. Ali wa nik bakaaɗi, wi na ɓayohe ŋ kakaan wala kerhiɗ Kooh wi na ɓayohe ŋ kiyurah, ɗu ñaamiŋ wi ɗu teyɗukiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 6:17" />Waaye Kooh corkiɗaah, ɗu nikee ñaam ciŋ bakaaɗ, waaye ɗu teyɗukiɗ ŋ keeñ ciŋ ɗu kotii jangɗohi ɗu rahas. <verse eid="ROM 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 6:18" />Kooh pulɗiɗ ɗu ŋ bakaaɗ, ɗu ñaam ciŋ kiyurah kotii. <verse eid="ROM 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 6:19" />Mi na woye na ɗu ŋ woyohaaɗ ɓo', sagu ne ɗu yooɓɗi kerah. Findi ɗu eɗohee cir ciŋ faan ciŋ ɗu ne ɗu ñaamuk hoolaaɗi na baahaaɗi, po ca ɓekka ɗu ŋ baahaaɗi, eɗohaat haf ɗu ɗaa, ɗu ñaamuk kiyurah ne wa ɓay ɗu ŋ eɗ haf ɗu Kooh.<verse eid="ROM 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 6:20" />Wa ɗu nik ñaam ciŋ bakaaɗ, kiyurah raakeeɗi waas nga ɗu. <verse eid="ROM 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 6:21" />Wa rimiɗ ɗu ye ? In ci kaci'iɗ ɗu woti. In ceem na ɓekohe kakaan ! <verse eid="ROM 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 6:22" />Waaye ɗiski wa nik, bakaaɗ raakisɗi waas nga ɗu, ɗu ñaam ciŋ Kooh, wa rimiɗ ɗu eɗ haf ɗu Kooh te ŋ mirndaana, wa onan ɗu kipes ki heyɗi reehe. <verse eid="ROM 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 6:23" />Kombot bakaaɗ na wirndohse kakaan ; waaye onohi Kooh na baahohe wa kipes ki heyɗi reehe ŋ niki ɗu nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, Heɗ ɓoo.<verse eid="ROM 6:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ROM 7" />
  <para style="s">Ɓoyi kos nikisɗi ñaamiŋ nakoh ciŋ waasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 7:1" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ inhiɗ ne mi na woye na ɓi inah waas, kon ɗu inhiɗ ne waas na yilfe ɓo' ŋ wi a na pese. <verse eid="ROM 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 7:2" />Wa mand na ɓitɓi toku, feeh ƴaar ce yii pes ɗah, e waas amb ɗe ŋ niyiŋ ƴaar ce ; waaye ƴaar ce kaan ɗah, a saɓsukohiɗ na waaseem. <verse eid="ROM 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 7:3" />Nik ne, ƴaar ce yii pes, a nik ɓitiɓ ƴaar wiiriis ɗah, a woysan ne a na njaalo'e, waaye ƴaar ce kaan ɗah, a saɓsukohiɗ na waaseem ; a nik ɓitiɓ ƴaar wiiriis ɗah, a njaalooɗi.<verse eid="ROM 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 7:4" />Wa nam mand ɗaa nga ɗu, ɓaah ciŋ ngo, taamboh ŋ kakaan kiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> ɗu kaaniɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waasi. Kon harmban ɗu na waasi reehiɗ, kotii, ɗu wuu ɓoyi kaan, hulitta ne ɓoo min rim in baahiɗ wuu Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 7:5" />Wa ɓoo meeɗ taambiɗ kiñin ciŋ ɓoo, nakoh ciŋ waasi yunee waaɗ-waaɗ ciŋ ɓoo baahaaɗiici. Te waaɗ-waaɗ ceem, ceɗ pangkee ŋ cir ciŋ faan ciŋ ɓoo, ne ca rimiɗ ɓoo kakaan. <verse eid="ROM 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 7:6" />Waaye, ɗiski wa nik, ɓoo kaaniɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waasi, ɓoo saɓsukohiɗ naa, weɗ wi ambee ɓoo <char style="w">ñaam</char>. Ɓoo ñaamkisɗi Kooh taamboh ŋ fiis ci maañiɗ ci, waaye ɓoo na ñaamkee ɗe taamboh ŋ in as puloh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>.<verse eid="ROM 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waasi na bakaaɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 7:7" />Kon ineem tokis ye ? Waasi na bakaaɗ, ca yino e ? Muk ! Waaye, ŋ heeɗi inhe ini bakaaɗ nik, ne waas raakeeɗi ɗah. Laam waasi woyeeɗi inii ɗah : « Fu waaɗɗanɗi haf fu iniŋ morom fu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:17">Pula 20:17</ref></char></note> », mbaa ŋ heeɗi inhe ne ineem bakaaɗ. <verse eid="ROM 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 7:8" />Ŋ ineem, bakaaɗ tonduk nakohii, ɓekka nga so waaɗ-waaɗ nu nik ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ in ɓo' ; waas raakɗi ɗah, bakaaɗ na nike ini kaan.<verse eid="ROM 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 7:9" />Ŋ maañ ɗah, mi, ŋ peseen te nakoh ciŋ waasi raakeeɗi ; waaye wi nakoh ciŋ waasi hay, bakaaɗ peseeɗa, <verse eid="ROM 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 7:10" />mi, ŋ kaannda. Ɗaa, nakohi, wi joyee so ɓay ŋ kipes, weɗ mirndoh ho ɓay ŋ kakaan. <verse eid="ROM 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 7:11" />Laam bakaaɗ tonduk nakohi, wa ñaañohha so. Wa taambohha nga, wa appa so. <verse eid="ROM 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 7:12" />Waaye waasi, wa in hooliɗ wuu Kooh, nakoh nu nik nga ɗah, wa in hooliɗ wuu Kooh, wa yurhiɗ te wa baahiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 7:13" />Kon in baahiɗ weɗ ap po e ? Muk ! Waaye bakaaɗ, ne wa teeɓoh haf wa, wa taamboh ŋ in baahiɗ, wa appa so. Ɗaa, wa taamboh ŋ nakohi, wa teeɓohha baahaaɗiikiŋ wa, wi raakɗi ɗiski wa top.<verse eid="ROM 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hiñohi nik ŋ ɗooƴ co</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 7:14" />Ɓoo inhiɗ ne waasi puloh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>, waaye mi, ŋ ɓo' dong ; ŋ ñaami bakaaɗ rom. <verse eid="ROM 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 7:15" />Ŋ inahɗi ini na tumɗukohee so ini mi na tume ; ini ŋ waaɗ tum, mi na tumeeɗaa, waaye ini ŋ sang, weɗ mi na tume. <verse eid="ROM 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 7:16" />Nik ne ini mi na tume, wa ini ŋ waaɗɗi tum ɗah, kon ŋ teyɗukiɗ ne waasi baahiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 7:17" />Nik ne wa ɗaa ɗah, a ñam na tumee haa, a bakaaɗi gen ŋ ɗooƴ co weɗ na tumɗukohee so.<verse eid="ROM 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 7:18" />Ŋ inhiɗ ne ali in baahiɗ genɗi nga so, maanaam mi yi ɓo' dong. Laam ŋ waaɗiɗ haɓiɗ ini baah, waaye ŋ minɗi wa haɓiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 7:19" />Mi na tumeeɗi ini ŋ waaɗ, in baahiɗ, waaye mi na tume baahaaɗiini, ini ŋ waaɗɗi. <verse eid="ROM 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 7:20" />Ŋ tumee ini ŋ waaɗɗi ɗah, mbaa a ñam na tumee wa haa, a bakaaɗi gen nga so.<verse eid="ROM 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 7:21" />Inii daal, ŋ hotiɗa nga so, weɗ ne : Ŋ waaɗta tum in baahiɗ ɗah, e baahaaɗi na hayɗohee so. <verse eid="ROM 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 7:22" />Ŋ ɗooƴ co, mi na raakohe ini neɓ po ŋ nakoh ciŋ waasiŋ Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 7:23" />Waaye ŋ in ci mi na tume jen, mi na hote waas wiiriis weɗ na hiñohe na waasi ŋ teyɗuk ŋ ɗooƴ co, waaseem weɗ amb mbo, wa taƴca so, weɗ waasiŋ bakaaɗi gen ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ngo jen. <verse eid="ROM 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 7:24" />Mas so deey ! Ya ɓa naafan ndo ŋ faanii na ɓayee so ŋ kakaan ?<verse eid="ROM 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 7:25" />Waaye Kooh corkiɗaah, a naafiɗ ɓoo taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa, Heɗ ɓoo !</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 7:25">Kon mi, ŋ ɗooƴ co, mi na pangkiɗe waasiŋ Kooh, waaye ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ngo, mi na pangkiɗe waas bakaaɗ.<verse eid="ROM 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ROM 8" />
  <para style="s">In ci Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani on ɓoo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 8:1" />Kon ɗiski wa nik, ɓi nik ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu, minisɗi atte'u kaan. <verse eid="ROM 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 8:2" />Laam, waasiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char> na onohe onoh kipes ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, wa pulɗiɗ ɓa ŋ waasiŋ bakaaɗ na kakaan. <verse eid="ROM 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 8:3" /><char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">Waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> mineeɗi ineem, laam faaniŋ ɓoo na waaɗ-waaɗ ciŋ wa ceɗ tah po waasiŋ Musaa raakɗi hatil. Waaye Kooh tumiɗa ŋ woosi a woos <char style="w" lemma="Kuɓkiŋ Kooh">Kuɓkiŋ ɗe</char> nga ɓoo na faan findi faan ciŋ bakaaɗoh ci ne a nihis bakaaɗ. Ŋ ineem, ŋ ɗooƴ faan, a atteesa bakaaɗ kaan. <verse eid="ROM 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 8:4" />A tum ineem ne kiyurhi waasi nakoh min raak nga ɓoo, ɓoo ɓi taambiɗɗi kiñin ciŋ ɓoo waaye Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani.<verse eid="ROM 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 8:5" />Laam, ɓi na taambɗe kiñin ciŋ ɓa, liiɓohaaɗiŋ ɓa hun na Adina. Waaye ɓi na taambɗe Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, liiɓohaaɗiŋ ɓa hun na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani. <verse eid="ROM 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 8:6" />Liiɓohaaɗi hun na Adina na ɓayohe ŋ kakaan, waaye wi hun na Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani na ɓayohe ŋ kipes na jam. <verse eid="ROM 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 8:7" />Ɓooɓi liiɓohaaɗ ciŋ ɓa hun na Adina, ɓa sangiɗ ciŋ Kooh, ɓa na taambɗeeɗi nakoh ciŋ ɗe, ɓa minɗaa sah. <verse eid="ROM 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 8:8" />Ɓi na pese ŋ taambiɗ kiñin ciŋ ɓa, ɓa minɗi neɓ Kooh.<verse eid="ROM 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 8:9" />Waaye ɗu, ŋ liiɓ ne <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char> geniɗ nga ɗu. Kon, ɗu pesɗi ŋ taambiɗ kiñin ciŋ ɗu, ɗu na pese ŋ Fuuɗsi. Laam yaa nu rahasɗi Fuuɗsiŋ Kiristaani ɗah, a ɓaahɗi nga ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 8:10" />Kiristaani nik nga ɗu ɗah, wa keeh ne faan ciŋ ɗu hey kaane sagu bakaaɗ, waaye liiɓohaaciŋ ɗu hey pese sagu kiyurhi ɗu onu taamboh ŋ Fuuɗsi yi na pesɗee ɗu. <verse eid="ROM 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 8:11" />Te Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh yi hultiɗ Yeesu Kiristaa gen nga ɗu ɗah, Kooh yi hultiɗ ɗe hey name pesiɗ faan ciŋ ɗu kaanan, taamboh ŋ Fuuɗsiŋ ɗe gen nga ɗu.<verse eid="ROM 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 8:12" />Mbaa ɓaah ciŋ ngo, wa keeh ne raakiɗ in ci ɓoo joy haɓiɗ, waaye taambiɗ kiñin ɓaahɗi nga. <verse eid="ROM 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 8:13" />Ɗu pesee ŋ taambiɗ kiñin ciŋ ɗu ɗah, ɗu hey kaane, waaye Fuuɗsi ɓaatɗohee ɗu po ɗu ap taambiɗ kiñin ciŋ ɗu ɗah, ɗu hey pese.<verse eid="ROM 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 8:14" />Laam ɓi Fuuɗsi adgoh jen, ɓa kuɓuuciŋ Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 8:15" />Te ɗu rahasɗi Fuuɗsi amban ɗu <char style="w">ñaam</char>, ne a dokin ɗu neƴƴoh, waaye ɗu rahas Fuuɗsi tum ɗu kuɓu Kooh, Fuuɗsi tah ɓoo ɓeeɗkee ɗe an : « <char style="tl">Abba</char> ! » Weɗ "Baab". <verse eid="ROM 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 8:16" />Fuuɗseem hun na liiɓ ciŋ ɓoo seede'ee ne ɓoo kuɓuuciŋ Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 8:17" />Nik ne ɓoo kuɓu ɗah, ɓoo hey rahse in ci Kooh gap kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, te ɓoo ɓaahan ca na Kiristaani ; nik ne ɓoo ɓaahiɗ na ɗe miskiɗ ɗah, ɓoo ɓaahan na ɗe yaki a yak.<verse eid="ROM 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Findi feruuɗi mand woti, na findi wa mandan kim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 8:18" />Wa wooriɗ to ne miskiɗ ciŋ ɓoo ŋ jamanoonii minɗi hendtiɗkohu na kiyak ki Kooh teeɓohan nga ɓoo kim. <verse eid="ROM 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 8:19" />Ini Kooh fer jen wa ɗii sek na seesuk keeh-keeh mbehi kuɓuuciŋ Kooh teeɓohsan. <verse eid="ROM 8:19" /><verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="ROM 8:20-21" />Laam ini Kooh fer jen, ɗiski wa nik, wa na tiinde ŋ ɓarang ɓarang. Wa tiiɗaa, e Kooh yi dega ineem, a yi tah. In ci jen ca ɗii yahrukoh. Waaye yaakaar raakiɗ poyi. Laam ca hey name pulɗu sah ŋ kiñaam kiŋ yahrukoheem ne ca raak haf ca, ca min ɓaah ŋ yaki kuɓuuciŋ Kooh yakan.<verse eid="ROM 8:20-21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 8:22" />Ɓoo inhiɗ ne po woti, in ci Kooh fer, findi ca hend jen, ceɗi iineeɗa sagu miskiɗ findi ɓitɓi na ɓasle. <verse eid="ROM 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 8:23" />Te ceɗ dong raak miskiɗ haa, na ɓoo, ɓoo ɓi rahas Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani findi waɗi koc, ɓoo ɓii nam iin ŋ ɗooƴ ɓoo, ɓoo ɓii sek ne ɓoo nik kuɓu Kooh keeh-keeh, ɓoo naafu po ɓoo raak haf ɓoo jameet.<verse eid="ROM 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 8:24" />Laam raak yaakaar, ooluk in ci na haye, weɗ muciɗ ɓoo, waaye in ci fu yaakaar nik na ɗa, fu hotee ca ɗah, wa nikisɗi yaakaar. <verse eid="ROM 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 8:25" />Waaye ɓoo ooluk ne ini ɓoo hotɗi hey haye ɗah, ɓoo heya seke na seesuk na muñ.<verse eid="ROM 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 8:26" />Fuuɗsi na ɓaatɗohe ɓoo ŋ ñaki ɓoo ñak hatil, laam ɓoo inahɗi ini ɓoo joy kiim. Waaye Fuuɗsi na haf ce na kiimɗe ɓoo na iin ci fu inah ne, ɓo' minɗi ca woo. <verse eid="ROM 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 8:27" />Te Yi na hote ini nik ŋ keeñ ci inhiɗ ini Fuuɗsi waaɗ kiim, laam Fuuɗsi na kiimɗe kosiɗ ciŋ Kooh findi Kooh waaɗoh.<verse eid="ROM 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 8:28" />Ɓoo inhiɗ ne Kooh na tume po in ci jen ambsukoh nik in baahiɗ ngaŋ ɓi waaɗ ɗe. Ɓooɓeem, e ɓooɓi Kooh ɓeeɗuk ŋ findi a kooɗkiɗohee wa. <verse eid="ROM 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 8:29" />Laam ɓi a inah ŋ ɗeɓgaana, a tufkiɗta ŋ ɗeɓgaana ne ɓa mandan na Kuɓkiŋ ɗe, ne Kuɓki nik saawi raak taambɗoh laayiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 8:30" />Te ɓi a kooɗ ŋ ɗeɓgaana, a namiɗ ɓa ɓeeɗuk ; ɓi a ɓeeɗuk, a namiɗ ɓa on kiyurah ; te ɓi a on kiyurah, a namiɗ ɓa yakiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Saahi ɓoo saah, wi taamboh ŋ waaɗohiŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 8:31" />Ɓoo woyissan ye ? Kooh yii na ɓoo, te nik ne a yii na ɓoo ɗah, ya ɓa miniɗ ɓoo in ? <verse eid="ROM 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 8:32" />Kooh, yi teyɗuk ne Kuɓkiŋ ɗe raak miskiɗ, a eɗohha ɗe wuu ɓoo jen, a eɗiɗ ɓoo Kuɓkiŋ ɗe ! Wa wooriɗ ne a hey baahohe ɓoo in ci jen findi a eɗoh ɓoo Kuɓkiŋ ɗe ! <verse eid="ROM 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 8:33" />Ɓi Kooh kooɗ, a ya ɓa yamban ɓa ? A Kooh na attee ɓoo te a yi woo ne ɓoo yurhiɗ ! <verse eid="ROM 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 8:34" />Kon ali ɓo' minɗi attee ɓoo ne ɓoo tooñiɗ. Laam Kiristaani Yeesu kaaniɗ ! Ɓaatta nga a hultiɗuusa, ɓaatissa nga a nik ŋ ñaahmaŋ Kooh, te a yaa kiimiɗ ɓoo !<verse eid="ROM 8:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 8:35" />Wa ye saɓsohan ɓoo na waaɗi Kiristaani waaɗ ɓoo ? Wa miskiɗ haa. Wa jaahiɗ haa. Wa tolfiɗ wala aɗuk haa. Wa ñak ɓekkaah haa. Te wa in wooraaɗi wala ndang haa ! <verse eid="ROM 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 8:36" />Ini Fiis ci woo weɗ rahas ɓoo, an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">« Saguufu, ɓoo na hooɓke dabgiɗu apu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 8:36">Ɓa amb ɓoo findi mbaal ci na hoosse.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 44:23">Sabuur 44:23</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 8:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ROM 8:37" />Waaye ŋ in ceem jen, a ɓoo saah po ɗiska saah top taamboh ŋ Yi waaɗ ɓoo. <verse eid="ROM 8:37" /><verse number="38-39" style="v" sid="ROM 8:38-39" />Laam wa wooriɗ to ne raakɗi ini min ɓoo saɓsoh na waaɗi a waaɗ ɓoo, wa kakaan haa, wa kipes haa, ca malaaka haa, ca safaal haa, wa woti wala kim haa, ca heɗ hatil haa, wa ɗafkiɗ wala nooɗiɗ haa, ca feruuɗ wiiriis haa, ali in minɗi ɓoo saɓsoh na waaɗi Kooh waaɗ ɓoo taamboh ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, Heɗ ɓoo.<verse eid="ROM 8:38-39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ROM 9" />
  <para style="s">Kooh na cuuɓiŋ ɗe Israayel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 9:1" />Ŋ niki ŋ nik ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>, mi na woye keeh, ŋ leyɗi. Ŋ ineem, liiɓiŋ ngo huniɗ na <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, te wa seede'iɗ to ini mi na hee woye wii : <verse eid="ROM 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 9:2" />Ŋ raakiɗ tiis keeh-keeh, te wa gen ndo misik ŋ ɗooƴ keeñ. <verse eid="ROM 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 9:3" />Nikeen ne ŋ kiim Kooh, a aluk ko, ŋ saɓsukoh na Kiristaani, wa heen tahe ɓaah ciŋ ngo muc ɗah, ŋ heena tume.<verse eid="ROM 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 9:4" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ɓeem, ɓeɗ Israayel ci. Ɓeɗ Kooh tum kuɓuuciŋ ɗe, niki a nik na ɓa ŋ yaki a yak, weɗ a baahoh ɓa, a ambtiɗohha na ɓa, a eɗta ɓa nakoh ciŋ waasi, a woosa ɓa findi ɓa ñaamkohan ɗe na in ci a gap ɓa, <verse eid="ROM 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 9:5" />caac ca maañiɗ ca ɓeɗ caac ciŋ ɓa, ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ faaniŋ Kiristaani, a ɓaah nga ɓa, Kiristaani yi nik ŋ ɗafuk in ci jen, a yi Kooh, te a yakɗaah po faw ! Amiin !<verse eid="ROM 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 9:6" />Wa nikɗi haa ne gapoh ciŋ Kooh nikisɗi. Laam ɓi puloh ŋ Israayel, wa nikɗi haa ne ɓa jen ɓa Israayel keeh-keeh. <verse eid="ROM 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 9:7" />Te ɓi rimkoh ŋ Ibrahiima, ɓa jen ɓeɗ kuɓuuciŋ ɗe keeh-keeh haa ; waaye Kooh woo Ibrahiima ne : « Fu raakohan ɓi rimkohan nga ɗa ŋ Isaahha.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 21:12">Camba 21:12</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 9:8" />Ineem tokis inii : A set ci Ibrahiima rimoot, ɓeɗ kuɓuuciŋ Kooh haa, waaye a kuɓuuci Kooh gapee ɗe ɓeɗ ambu findi ɓi rimkoh nga ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 9:9" />Inii weɗ gapohi Kooh gapee Ibrahiima : « Ŋ hey dokkisse ndii maas, ŋ raakan Saarata raakiɗ kuɓu ƴaar.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:10-14">Camba 18:10-14</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 9:10" />Ɓaatta nga, a tumoh ɗaa na Rebeka, e siis ciŋ ɗe ɓeɗ ɓaahee baab yino, a nikka Isaahha, caac ɓoo. <verse eid="ROM 9:10" /><verse number="11-13" style="v" sid="ROM 9:11-13" />Raak siis ceem rimuuɗi paaɗ, ɓa tumeeɗi baahiɗ wala baahaaɗi. Moona, Kooh woyeen Rebeka ne : « Yi ƴini hey yilfe yi yakki.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 25:23">Camba 25:23</ref> </char></note> » Findi Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyoha an : « Ŋ tan Yaŋhooɓa, ŋ faɗta Esaaw.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:11-13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 1:2-3">Malasi 1:2-3</ref></char></note> » Ineem raakiɗ ne wa nikiɗ ini Kooh tufkiɗe. Kooh na tane ŋ findi a waaɗoh, wa gaƴukɗi ŋ tumohaaɗ ciŋ ɓoyi, waaye, ŋ Kooh yi na ɓeeɗke ɓoyi.<verse eid="ROM 9:11-13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 9:14" />Ɓoo woyan ye ŋ ineem nak ? Kooh yurahɗi e ? Muk ! Ineem minɗi nik ! <verse eid="ROM 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 9:15" />A woo <char style="w">Musaa</char> ne : « Ŋ hey yirme yi ŋ waaɗ yirim, te ŋ baahohee yi ŋ waaɗ baahoh.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 33:19">Pula 33:19</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 9:16" />Mbaa, wa nikɗi ŋ ɓoyi na waaɗee wa wala yi na ndengɗuke nga, waaye ŋ Kooh, yi na yirmohe.<verse eid="ROM 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 9:17" />Ŋ Fiis ci, Kooh woo <char style="w">Firawna</char> ne : « Ñam tufkiɗ ɗa ne ŋ min teeɓoh hatiliŋ ngo taamboh nga ɗa te tiikiŋ ngo wil kehƴi jen.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 9:16">Pula 9:16</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 9:18" />Kon a yi na yirme yi a waaɗ yirim, a ndengɗee keeñiŋ yi a waaɗ ndengiɗ keeñiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="ROM 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kooh a yi na tane findi a waaɗoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 9:19" />Ŋ inhiɗ ne fu hey yo woye ne : « Nik ne ɓo' minɗi nookoh na waaɗ-waaɗiŋ Kooh ɗah, kon wa ye tah Kooh ngaske ɓo' ? » <verse eid="ROM 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 9:20" />Waaye fu yi ɓo' dong, a fu ɓa po fu taastiɗohee na Kooh ? Andi ini mahu hey woye yi maha ne : « Wa ye tah fu mahohha so an ? » <verse eid="ROM 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 9:21" />Mahohi, andi waas onɗi ɗe ne a ɓay ŋ ɗokiŋ ɗe, a mah in kanak naa, wii njirñiɗkoha ŋ ceeke, wi tas njirñiɗkoha ŋ in ci ƴin ƴin ci ?<verse eid="ROM 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 9:22" />Moo ɓo' raak ye woyaah nga, nik ne Kooh muñɗee muñiɗ in maañiɗ ɓooɓi a ayruke, ɓi nikee ŋ kot sooƴ, sagu waaɗi a waaɗee teeɓoh ayrukiŋ ɗe na hatiliŋ ɗe ɗah. <verse eid="ROM 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 9:23" />Te a namee waaɗ teeɓoh yaki a yak keeh-keeh ŋ ɓooɓi misik ɗe ; ɓi a kooɗkiɗ ne ɓa ɓaah ŋ yaki a yak. <verse eid="ROM 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 9:24" />Ɓooɓeem, e ɓoo. A ɓeeɗkoh ɓoo ŋ ɗooƴ Yawuut ci dong haa, waaye ŋ ɓi namɗi nik Yawuut. <verse eid="ROM 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 9:25" />Findi a woyoha ŋ teerndiŋ woosuuɗi Hose an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">« Ɓi nikeeɗi cuuɓiŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Ŋ ɓeeɗkohan ɓa "cuuɓiŋ ngo",</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Te cuuɓi waaɗseeɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:25">Ŋ woyana : “ Ŋ waaɗiɗ ɗa !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:25">Hose 2:25</ref></char></note> ” »<verse eid="ROM 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 9:26" />« Te ɗiski ɓa woyohsee ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">“ Ɗu cuuɓiŋ ngo haa, ”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">ɓa ɓeeɗkohsan nga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:26">kuɓuuciŋ Koohi na pese !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 2:1">Hose 2:1</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 9:27" />Ɓoo namiɗ hot ŋ Fiis ci ne woosuuɗi Esayi looƴkiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Israayel an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">« Ali Israayel ci laay po</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">ɓa hend na merhey miŋ cookmi sah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">ɓa hey haawsasse po</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:27">e tasɗohiiniŋ ɓa dong mucɗassan ;<verse eid="ROM 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 9:28" />laam Heɗi, a hey tume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:28">ini a woyee ŋ ɗafuk kehƴi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:28">a heya tume tum mitiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:28">te wa gaaw !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:28 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 10:22-23">Esayi 10:22-23</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 9:29" />Te findi woosuuɗi Esayi namohisa woo maañiɗ an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">« Heɗi na malaakaaciŋ ɗe faɗɗeeɗi ɓoo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">ɓi rimkoh nga ɓoo ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">ɓoo hee nike findi Sodom,<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19">Camba 19</ref></char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:29">ɓoo hee mande na Gomor !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 1:9">Esayi 1:9</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ini Pool waaɗiɗ Israayel ci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 9:30" />Mbaa ɓoo woyan ye ŋ ineem ? Ɓi nikɗi Yawuut waakeeɗi kiyurah, waaye ɓa rahsiɗa, ɓa rahasa taamboh ŋ kosi ɓa kos, <verse eid="ROM 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 9:31" />te Israayel ci waakee waasi min ɓa on kiyurah waaye ɓa raakɗaa. <verse eid="ROM 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 9:32" />Wa ye tah ? Laam, Israayel ci waakeeɗi wa taamboh ŋ kos, ɓa waakee wa taamboh ŋ tumohaaɗ. Ɓa kafnduk ŋ atoh fi na kafndohe, <verse eid="ROM 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 9:33" />findi wa fiisohu an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">« Ŋ degiɗ atoh kafndoha ŋ Siyong,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">atoh fi na folohe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">waaye yaa nu taɓah kosiŋ ɗe ŋ atoh feem ɗah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 9:33">a kaci'anɗi !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Esayi 28:16</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 8:14">8:14</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 9:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ROM 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 10:1" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo kosiɗ ci, ini ŋ waaɗiɗ cuuɓiŋ Israayel ŋ keeñiŋ ngo na ini mi na kiimɗee ɓa Kooh, weɗ ne ɓa muc. <verse eid="ROM 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 10:2" />Mi yii seede'iɗ ɓa ne ɓa sawriɗ lool ŋ pangkiɗ Kooh, waaye wa hunɗi na ki'inah. <verse eid="ROM 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 10:3" />Ñak inah kiyurhi puloh ŋ Kooh, na waaɗ tufkiɗoot kiyurhiŋ ɓa haf ɓa, weɗ tah po ɓa teyɗukɗi kiyurhi puloh ŋ Kooh.<verse eid="ROM 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 10:4" />
    <char style="w" lemma="waasiŋ Musaa">Waasiŋ</char> <char style="w">Musaa</char> mitoh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char>. Ineem weɗ tah yaa nu kos ɗah raak kiyurah.<verse eid="ROM 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yaa nu kos ɗah hey mucɗasse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 10:5" />Musaa fiisiɗ ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kiyurhi puloh ŋ nakoh ci ne : « Yaa nu taambiɗ in cii ɗah, ceɗ a pesohan.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:5">Lewiici 18:5</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 10:6" />Waaye ɓooɓi onu kiyurah taamboh ŋ kosi ɓa kos woo in wiiriis, an : « Kina woo ŋ ɗooƴ fu ne : Ya ɓa rapan ŋ Asamaan ? » Woo keem waaɗ woo ne : Ya ɓa rapan ne a ruhsiɗ Kiristaani. <verse eid="ROM 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 10:7" />Ɓa nam woo ne : « Kina woo ŋ ɗooƴ fu ne : Ya ɓa ruhsan ŋ nunga topaaɗiina ? » Woo keem waaɗ woo ne : Ya ɓa ruhsan ne a puliɗ Kiristaani ŋ kaaniɗ ca. <verse eid="ROM 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 10:8" />Kon ɓooɓeem woo inii : « Woo ki weɗi ŋ seroofu, weɗi ŋ nguɓiŋ ɗa, weɗi ŋ ɗooƴ keeñiŋ ɗa. » - Woo keem weɗ woo ki ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kosi, wi ɓoo na yegɗohe<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ŋ aayaacii, ini kooɗoh aaya 6 po 8, Pool na woye ŋ ini fiisu ŋ teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 9:4">Rohƴiɗi 9:4</ref></char>, a ambsoha na teerndiŋ <char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 30:11-14">Rohƴiɗi 30:11-14</ref></char>, a nammbaa ambsohis na ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>. Wa nikee woyohaaɗ ŋ jamanoonaam.</char></note>.<verse eid="ROM 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 10:9" />Laam fu woo na nguɓiŋ ɗa ŋ fiki ɓooɓi ne Yeesu a yi Heɗi, te fu kos ŋ keeñiŋ ɗa ne Kooh hultiɗiɗ ɗe ɗah, fu hey mucɗasse. <verse eid="ROM 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 10:10" />Keeñ weɗ na kose, wa tum ɗa ɓo' yurhiɗ, te nguɓ weɗ na woye, wa ɓay ɗa ŋ muc. <verse eid="ROM 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 10:11" />Fiis ci ceɗ woo ne : « Yaa nu taɓah kosiŋ ɗa nga ɗe ɗah, fu kaci'anɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:16">Esayi 28:16</ref> </char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wa ye hondoh Yawuut ci kos Kiristaani ?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 10:12" />Ɓooɓi jen ɓeɗ hend ŋ fiki Kooh, wa Yawuut haa, wa nikaaɗi Yawuut haa, ɓa jen ɓeɗ ɓaah Heɗ, te Heɗ ɓa, yaa nu ɓeeɗuk ɗe ne a naaf ɗa ɗah, a baahoh ɗa ŋ raak-raakiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 10:13" />Laam wa fiisuuɗ ne : « Yaa nu ɓeeɗuk Heɗi ɗah, a hey mucɗasse.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOL 3:5">Yowel 3:5</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 10:14" />Waaye ɓa ɓeeɗkohee ɗah, raakee ɓa kosiɗ haa e ? Te ɓa kos ɗah, raakee ɓa kerhiɗ yegɗohiŋ Yi ɓa kos. Te ɓa kerah yegɗoh ɗah, raakee a ɓo' woo ɓa wa. <verse eid="ROM 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 10:15" />Te ɓo' woo ɓa wa ɗah, raakee ɗe woosu woosu. Findi Fiis ci woyoha an : « Cey, kot ci ɓa tiind moɗiɗ, ɓi hay na yegɗoh neɓiɗ !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:7">Esayi 52:7</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 10:16" />Waaye ɓi kerah yegɗoheem, e ɓeɗ jen na tume ini wa woo haa, findi woosuuɗi Esayi woyohee wa ne : « Heɗi, yaa kos yegɗohiŋ ɓoo ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:1">Esayi 53:1</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 10:17" />Kon, kos na pulohe ŋ ini kerhu, te ini kerhu na pulohe ŋ yegɗohi kaɗ ŋ Kiristaani. <verse eid="ROM 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 10:18" />Waaye mi na meeksohe : Ɓi Israayel kerahɗi kerahɗi e ? Aha'kay ! Fiis ci woyiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">« Hoosoociŋ ɓa kerhuuɗ ŋ kehƴi jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:18">woo ciŋ ɓa kaɗiɗ po ŋ ɗisik ca uup us ŋ Adina !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 19:5">Sabuur 19:5</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 10:19" />Waaye mi na meeksohe : Ɓa inahɗi inahɗi ini woyu e ? Aha'kay ! Ŋ ineem, Musaa, a yi koc woo ne Kooh woo an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">« Ŋ hey ɗu tahe siis ɓi nikɗi cuuɓ ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:19">ŋ tah ɗu ayruk cuuɓ ñaañaaɗi.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:21">Rohƴiɗi 32:21</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 10:20" />Woosuuɗi Esayi kaannja po a woosa ini Kooh woo, an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">« Ɓi waakeeɗi so, mirndohiɗ to hot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:20">ɓi meeksohɗi so, mirndohha so inah.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:1">Esayi 65:1</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 10:21" />Waaye ini kaɗ ŋ Israayel, a woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">« Ŋ hooɓuk raɗis yaah ne ŋ morgiɗuk</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 10:21">ɓi kerhiɗɗi so, ɓi na taasee so.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 65:2">Esayi 65:2</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 10:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ROM 11" />
  <para style="s">Kooh faɗɗi cuuɓiŋ ɗe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 11:1" />Mi na meeksohe : Kooh faɗ faɗ cuuɓiŋ ɗe e ? Muk ! Mi ŋ haf fo ŋ ɓaah ŋ Israayel, ŋ puloh ŋ Ibrahiima, ŋ cuuɓiŋ Benyaamin. <verse eid="ROM 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 11:2" />Kooh faɗɗi cuuɓiŋ ɗe, cuuɓi a inah maañ. Ɗu inhiɗ ini Fiis ci woo ŋ ineem, ŋ saari <char style="w">Ilyas</char> ñaɗtukee ŋ Israayel ci ŋ fiki Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 11:3" />A woosa ne : « Heɗi, ɓa apiɗ woosuuɗ ciŋ ɗa, ɓa pooksohiɗ <char style="w" lemma="seeƴuk">seeƴkohaaci</char> na seeƴkohse wuu fu ; mi, ŋ tas kiik ko kotii te ɓa ɗii waaɗ to ap.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:10">1 Buur ci 19:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 19:14">19:14</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 11:4" />Waaye Kooh lof ye nga ? A woo ɗe ne : « Ŋ ɗaakɗiɗ haf fo ƴaar junni-yasna-kanak (7000), ɓi moosɗi ƴekiɗ Ba'al<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ba'al </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a ɓaahee ŋ kooh ci nikaaɗiici meeɗ ñaamku ŋ jamanoonaŋ Ilyas (</char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 18:16-40">1 Buur ci 18:16-40</ref></char>).</note>.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:18">1 Buur ci 19:18</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 11:5" />Te wa mand ɗaa woti-woti, raakiɗ ɓi tas ŋ Israayel ci, ɓi kooɗu taamboh ŋ baahohiŋ Kooh.<verse eid="ROM 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 11:6" />Nik ne ɓa baahohu baahohu ɗah, in ci ɓa tum tahɗi ɓa kooɗu ; mbaa baahoh nikisɗi baahoh. <verse eid="ROM 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 11:7" />Kon ɓo' min ye woo ? Ini Israayel ci waake, ɓa raakɗaa ; e ɓi kooɗu nga ɓa raaka, ɓinooɓi, keeñ ciŋ ɓa ndengɗu ndengɗu. <verse eid="ROM 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 11:8" />Findi wa fiisohu an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">« Kooh neehɗiɗ ñaañiŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">a hondohha has ciŋ ɓa hot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">a hondohha nof ciŋ ɓa kerah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:8">te wa ɗaa po woti.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:3">Rohƴiɗi 29:3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 29:10">Esayi 29:10</ref> </char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 11:9" />Te Dawuuda woyiɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">« Ɓeeɗkoh kañam ciŋ ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">nikaat nga ɓa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">mbipi amban ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">wa nik mbaali ɓa longohan,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">wa nik kafndohaani folan ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:9">wa nik wirndiŋ ɓa !<verse eid="ROM 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 11:10" />Has ciŋ ɓa ñuusaat tuɗ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">po ɓa hotissuu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">njuuƴɗa leero-finhoociŋ ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:10">ɓa taalndiɗ ɗaa !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:23-24">Sabuur 69:23-24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:8">Sabuur 35:8</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ɓi nikɗi Yawuut gerefe'uuɗ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 11:11" />Kon mi na meeksohe : Andi kafnduki ɓa kafnduk, ɓa keen keen po ɓa minisɗi kuruk e ? Muk ! Waaye ɗali ɓa ɗal tahiɗ po ɓi nikɗi Yawuut eɗuuɗ muci, ne Israayel ci siis ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 11:12" />Nik ne a ɗali ɓa ɗal weɗ tah Adina raak ini yakki wa raak ɗah, te nik ne keeniŋ ɓa weɗ on ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ini yakki ɓa raak ɗah, kon wa wooriɗ ne Yawuut ci jen muc ɗah, ini wa onohan hey uupe yak fuuf !<verse eid="ROM 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 11:13" />Ɗu ɓi nikɗi Yawuut, mi na woye na ɗu : Ñam <char style="tl"><char style="w" lemma="apootar">Apootariŋ</char></char> ɗu, ŋ neɓuuɗ ŋ pangki Kooh eɗ to. <verse eid="ROM 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 11:14" />Ŋ waaɗ ne findi wa min nikoh ɗah, ɓooɓiŋ cuuɓiŋ ngo siis ɗu ŋ kosi ɗu kos, po wa muciɗ ɓi ɓo' nga ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 11:15" />Nik ne e ɓakɗi ɓa ɓakɗu tah Adina kerhiɗoh na Kooh ɗah, kon Kooh dokin ɓa ɗah, wa nikan ye ? Wa nikanɗi hultiŋ kaaniɗ ci e ?<verse eid="ROM 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 11:16" />Nik ne mbuuruuci koc hooliɗ wuu Kooh ɗah, ini tas ŋ muni siiɓuuɗi jen hooliɗ wuu ce<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 15:19-21">Kind ci 15:19-21</ref></char></note> ; te nik ne niiri hooliɗ wuu Kooh ɗah, naak ci na car ci namiɗ hool wuu ce. <verse eid="ROM 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 11:17" />Waaye raakiɗ car ci nihsu ŋ kidgiŋ oliiwi, te fu yi nikee car oliiw ɓaɓiɗ, fu gerefe'uusa ŋ ɗisik ci car ceem nikee, fu raakiɗ ɓak ŋ niiri, na ñif miŋ oliiwi baahiɗi. <verse eid="ROM 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 11:18" />Waaye kina yaksiɗuk ŋ car ceem. Fu tuma ɗah, kina alkoh ne a fu raan niiri haa, waaye a niiri raan ɗa.<verse eid="ROM 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 11:19" />Ŋ inhiɗ ne fu woyan ne : « Ca car ceɗ nihsu, ne ŋ gerefe'u. » <verse eid="ROM 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 11:20" />Ineem keeh, waaye e ñak kos tah ca nihsu, te fu, e kos tah ɗa tufuk. Kina yaksiɗuk ŋ ineem, waaye neƴƴoha ; <verse eid="ROM 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 11:21" />laam nik ne e car ciŋ kidgi ceɗ Kooh nihis ɗah, amba ne a faɗan ɗa haa.<verse eid="ROM 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 11:22" />Mbaa marka findi Kooh baahoh na findi a na muñɗoheeɗi in baahaaɗi. A na muñɗeeɗi ɓi keen ŋ bakaaɗ, a baahiɗ nga ɗa. Waaye fu joy gen gaƴuk ŋ baah kiŋ ɗe ; wa ɗal ineem ɗah, fu hey name nihsu. <verse eid="ROM 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 11:23" />Te ɓeɗ, ɓa risɗi ŋ kosaaɗiikiŋ ɓa ɗah, ɓa hey name gerefe'u ; laam Kooh herñiɗ ne a gerefe'is ɓa ŋ ɗiska ɓa nike. <verse eid="ROM 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 11:24" />Nik ne fu, fu yi cari nihsohu ŋ oliiwi ɓaɓ, wi fu mbaahkoh, a fu gerefe'u ŋ oliiw baahiɗ, wi nikɗi mbaahiŋ ɗa ɗah, ŋ woyisɗi ɓeɗ ɓi na hee gerefe'se ŋ oliiwi ɓa puloh.<verse eid="ROM 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cuuɓ ci jen mucɗu ɗah, Israayel jen hey muce</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 11:25" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ waaɗɗi ne ɗu nik inhaaɗi ini ɗasɗukiɗii, po ɗu kee liiɓa ne ɗu inhiɗ, weɗ ne : Ɓak ngaŋ cuuɓiŋ Israayel risan ndeng keeñ, po cuuɓ ci cinooci jen rahas muci. <verse eid="ROM 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 11:26" />Teemb ndeem, Israayel jen hey mucɗasse, findi wa fiisohu an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">« Mucɗohi kurkohan Siyong, a hay.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:26">A nihis kaañ-Kooh ki nik ŋ cuuɓiŋ Yaŋhooɓa ;<verse eid="ROM 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 11:27" />te ineem weɗ nikan</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">ambtiɗohiŋ ngo na ɓa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:27">mbaɗna ŋ nihsan bakaaɗ ciŋ ɓa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 27:9">Esayi 27:9</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 59:20-21">59:20-21</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 11:28" />Ini ɓa sang teyɗuk <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, tahiɗ po ɓa sangiɗ ciŋ Kooh, wa nikka muuɗiŋ ɗu, waaye poyi, ɓa ris cuuɓi Kooh kooɗ, te a waaɗiɗ ɓa, sagu ambtiɗohi a ambtiɗohee na caac caŋ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 11:29" />Laam Kooh baahoh ɓo' in wala a ɓeeɗuk ɓo' ɗah, inwaaso moosanɗi amb Kooh nga. <verse eid="ROM 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 11:30" />Ɗu kerhiɗeeɗi Kooh ɗeɓgaan te ɗiski wa nik ɗu yirmuuɗ taamboh ŋ ini Yawuut ci kerhiɗɗi ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 11:31" />Ɗiski wa nik wa mand ɗaa, kerhiɗaaɗiikiŋ ɓa ɓekiɗ yirmuukiŋ ɗu, ini Kooh waaɗ weɗ ne yirmuukiŋ ɗu ɓek yirmuukiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 11:32" />Kooh taƴ ɓooɓi jen ŋ kerhiɗaaɗiikiŋ ɓa, ne a yirim ɓa jen.<verse eid="ROM 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 11:33" />Cey !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:33">Moɗkiŋ liiɓohaaɗiŋ Kooh</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:33">na ki'inhiŋ ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:33">ca nooɗiɗ lool</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:33">te ca laaɓpa keeh-keeh !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:33">In ci a kooɗuk tum</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:33">minɗi acsuku</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:33">te waas ciŋ ɗe minɗi inhu !<verse eid="ROM 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ROM 11:34" />« Ya ɓa inhe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">liiɓiŋ Heɗi ?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:34">Ya ɓa dengee ɗe ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:13">Esayi 40:13</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 11:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ROM 11:35" />« Ya ɓa wotiɗ ɗe kombot,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:35">po a joyya ɗe wa wirind ?<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 41:3">Ayooɓa 41:3</ref> </char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 11:35" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ROM 11:36" />In ci jen puloh nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:36">in ci jen nikiɗ taamboh nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:36">in ci jen wuu ce.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:36">A yi yakɗaah po faw !</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 11:36" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 11:36">Amiin !<verse eid="ROM 11:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ROM 12" />
  <para style="s">Kipes ki asi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 12:1" />Kon nak, ɗu ɓi ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ yirmi Kooh yirim ɗu weem, mi yii ñaah ɗu, ɗu eɗ ɗe haf ɗu jen, ɗu nik findi seeƴkuuɗi na pese, wi hool wuu ce te a neɓuusa nga. Jaar wa nik ñaamki ɗu joy ɗe ñaamuk keeh-keeh. <verse eid="ROM 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 12:2" />Kinaat taambiɗ ɓi adinaanii po ɗu mand na ɓa, faɗaat Kooh a on ɗu liiɓohaaɗ as ne wa ɓoƴsoh ɗu, ɗu min inhisoh waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɗe. Waaɗ-waaɗiŋ ɗe weɗ baah, wa neɓpa ɗe te wa mitta.<verse eid="ROM 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 12:3" />Ŋ ini ŋ baahohu, mi na woyee ɗu ne ali ɓo' nga ɗu kinaat deg haf ce ŋ ɗiski a reeɗi, waaye topɗaat haf ɗu ŋ ɗiski ɗu top, wa hend na kosi Kooh waɗ ɓo' nu nga ɗah. <verse eid="ROM 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 12:4" />Laam findi faan nikoh yino, wa raakka cir laayiɗ te ca jen ca ɓaahɗi ini ca na haɓɗe, <verse eid="ROM 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 12:5" />wa mand ɗaa nga ɓoo, ali ɓoo laayoh na, ɓoo faan yino ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> te ɓoo jen ambsukohha nikka cir ci.<verse eid="ROM 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 12:6" />Waaye in ci ɓoo onu, caɗ ɗaloh, ca hun na baahohi ɓoo baahohu, yaa nu nga ɗah. Nik ne ɓoyi onuuɗ ne Kooh woyee taamboh nga ɗe ɗah, a woyaat ini hun na kosi ɓoo kos. <verse eid="ROM 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 12:7" />Nik ne ɓo' onu ne a taambkoh ɓinooɓi ɗah, a taambkohaat ɓa. Ɓo' onu ne a jangiɗ ɓooɓi ɗah, a jangɗaat ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 12:8" />Yi onu ne a ñaahoh, a ñaahohaat. Yi na onohe, onohaat te Kooh tah. Yi adgoh, a tokɗukaat nga. Yi na ɓaatɗohe ɓi nik ŋ miskiɗ, tumaata na sum.<verse eid="ROM 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 12:9" />Waaɗohiŋ ɗu nikaat keeh. Sepeƴnukaat baahaaɗi, te ɗu ŋoɗ ngaŋ baahiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 12:10" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ waaɗoh, waaɗtiɗohaat findi ɓooɓi ɓaah yaay na baab. Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ eɗoh cir, yaa nu nga ɗah uupsiɗkohaat eɗ cir morom ce. <verse eid="ROM 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 12:11" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ sawar, ali ɓo' kinaat tiriɓ. Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, yaa nu nga ɗah yoondɗukaat. Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Heɗi, ñaamkaat ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 12:12" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ ooluk in ci na haye, sumaat. Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ miskiɗ ci, muñaat. Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ kiim Kooh, genaat gen nga. <verse eid="ROM 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 12:13" />Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ etoh ciŋ <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char>, ɓaatɗohaat ɓa nga ca. Ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ daliɗ hanhe, ndengɗukaat nga.<verse eid="ROM 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 12:14" />Kiimɗaat barke ɓi na tolfiɗee ɗu, barke'ɗaat te kinaat kiimiɗ ɓo' a alku. <verse eid="ROM 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 12:15" />Hunaat ɗu sum na sumiɗ ci, fuɗaat na fuɗoh ci. <verse eid="ROM 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 12:16" />Kerhiɗohaat ŋ harmban ɗu. Kinaat waak in yakak, waaye keeñ ciŋ ɗu hiiraat ɗu ŋ ɓooɓi heefuuɗ ci<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">"ɓooɓi heefuuɗ ci" : ini gerek woo ndii, wa namiɗ min tokis : "in ci heefuuɗ ci".</char></note>. Kinaat amb ŋ haf ɗu ne ɗu inhiɗ in nu in. <verse eid="ROM 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 12:17" />Kinaat tum miskiɗ yi tum ɗu miskiɗ. Liiɓaat ŋ tum in baahiɗ, ini ɓooɓi jen min teyɗuk. <verse eid="ROM 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 12:18" />Wa min nik ɗah, pesaat ŋ jam na ɓooɓi jen, po ɗiska min-miniŋ ɗu top.<verse eid="ROM 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 12:19" />Ɓaah ciŋ ngo ŋ keeñkoh, kinaat wirndukiɗ haf ɗu, faɗaat ayrukiŋ Kooh, wa tum ini wa joy tum. Fiis ci Hooliɗ ci woyiɗ ne Heɗi woo ne : « Ñam raak wirndiɗkoh, ñam na hee wirnduke tumohaaɗ ci moɗaaɗiici !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:25">Rohƴiɗi 32:25</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 12:20" />Waaye ɓoo nak, Fiis ci nam woo ne : « Yi sang ɗa aɗuk ɗah, eɗaa ɗe a ñam ; a sifaɗuk ɗah, eɗaa ɗe a an. Fu tum ineem ɗah, fu na ɓekee ɗe kaci.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 25:21-22">Gonaah ci 25:21-22</ref></char></note> » <verse eid="ROM 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 12:21" />Baahaaɗi kinaat ɗa min, minaa wa na baahiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ROM 13" />
  <para style="s">Teyɗukiɗ kilifaaci tufkiɗu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 13:1" />Yaa nu nga teyɗukɗaat kilifaaci tufkiɗu ; raakɗi yi na nike kilifa te wa pulohɗi ŋ Kooh, te ɓi nik kilifa nga ɗa, a Kooh tufkiɗ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 13:2" />Yaa nu sang teyɗukiɗ nguur ɗah, a sang teyɗuk ini Kooh tufkiɗ ; ɓi na tume ineem hey degse ŋ waas.<verse eid="ROM 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 13:3" />Ɓi tufkiɗu neƴƴohaah haa nik ne fu na tume baahiɗ ɗah, waaye nik ne fu na tume baahaaɗi ɗah, ɓa neƴƴohaah. Fu waaɗiɗ sang neƴƴoh ɓi tufkiɗu e ? Tuma baahiɗ, fu raak corkiɗiŋ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 13:4" />Ɓa nik ŋ pangkiŋ Kooh wuu ini baah nga ɗa. Waaye fu tum baahaaɗi ɗah, neƴƴohaa ɓa, ɓa ganaayukɗi ŋ ɓarang ɓarang. Ɓa nik ŋ pangkiŋ Kooh ne ɓa degohee ŋ waas, ɓa na tiindɗe ayrukiŋ Kooh ngaŋ yi na tume baahaaɗi. <verse eid="ROM 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 13:5" />Ineem weɗ tah, wa etohiɗ ne fu teyɗuk ɓa ; neƴƴoh ayruki dong kinaat tah, waaye wa namaat nik ne hel onohiɗ ne wa waas.<verse eid="ROM 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 13:6" />Ineem weɗ nam tah po ɗu wirnde lempo. Laam, kilifaaci, ɓa na pangkiɗe Kooh te wirndiŋ lempooni, ɓa na faɗohee wa faɗoh nof. <verse eid="ROM 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 13:7" />Eɗaat ɓa yaa nu nga ini ɗu joy ɗe eɗ ; eɗaat lempooni yi ɗu joya eɗ, ɗu eɗ juutiini yi ɗu joya eɗ, ɗu nup yi ɗu joy nup, ɗu eɗ cir yi ɗu joya eɗ.<verse eid="ROM 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Waaɗoh weɗ mitiɗ waas</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 13:8" />Kinaat raakɗoh ɓo' ali in, ɗal waaɗi ɗu joy waaɗtiɗoh ; yaa nu waaɗ morom ce ɗah, a mitɗiɗ ini waasi nakoh. <verse eid="ROM 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 13:9" />Ŋ ineem nakoh ci findi "kina njaaloo," "kina ap ɓo' ", "kina rok", "kina waaɗiɗ haf fu iniŋ morom fu",<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-17">Pula 20:13-17</ref></char></note> na cinooci jen, ca woyuuɗ ŋ rohƴiɗ an : « Waaɗa morom fu findi fu waaɗoh haf fu. »<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lewiici 19:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="ROM 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 13:10" />Waaɗoh na tumoheeɗi miskiɗ, kon waaɗoh weɗ mitiɗ waas.<verse eid="ROM 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kooɗkiɗaat hayiŋ Kiristaani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 13:11" />Ɗu inhiɗ jamanooni ɓoo nikoh : Wa reyiɗ ne ɗu yunuk, laam ina ɓoo camboh kos poyi, muci uup ɓoo nga reɓ. <verse eid="ROM 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 13:12" />Weki usiɗ, Kooh mand na wiisiɗ. Ɓoo wolkaat in ci na haɓɗasse ŋ ñuusi, ɓoo ɓekuk in ci siñaari na hiñohohe. <verse eid="ROM 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 13:13" />Ɓoo pesaat pes lakiɗ waas findi ɓi nik ŋ noh cong, wa hunuu na mbuumbaay na laar, wa hunuu na faankoh sangohuuɗ na cakaay, wa hunuu na lahtoh na siisoh. <verse eid="ROM 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 13:14" />Waaye ɓekkaat mandohaaɗiŋ Heɗi Yeesu <char style="w">Kiristaa</char>, te kinaat waak findi ɗu tumohan ne ɗu taambiɗ waaɗ-waaɗ ci baahaaɗiiciŋ faan ciŋ ɗu.<verse eid="ROM 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ROM 14" />
  <para style="s">Kina atte, kina heef morom fu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 14:1" />Teyɗukaat yi kosiŋ ɗe ndengɗi, te kinaat lahtuk ŋ liiɓohaaɗiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 14:2" />Ɓum kos ne ɓa miniɗ ñam kañam ci jen ; ɓinooɓi kosiŋ ɓa ndengɗi, ɓa na ñame kidig na paangi dong. <verse eid="ROM 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 14:3" />Yi na ñame kañam ci jen kinaat heef yi na ñameeɗi, te yi na ñameeɗi kinaat atte yi na ñame, laam Kooh teyɗukiɗ ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 14:4" />A fu ɓa po fu atte'ee surga jaambur ? A tufuk ŋ pangkiŋ ɗe wala a keen nga, waas fu nguu nga, a yi inah na heɗ ce. Te a risan tufkiɗ, laam Heɗi miniɗ ɗe ndengiɗ.<verse eid="ROM 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 14:5" />Wa nam mand ɗaa, raakiɗ ɓi amb ne mbeh ci uupsiɗohiɗ yak, ɓum amb ne caɗ hend. Kon yaa nu nga liiɓiŋ ɗe doyaat ɗe ! <verse eid="ROM 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 14:6" />Yi eɗ mbeh cum cir ŋ ɗafuk cinooci, a na tumee wa ne a yakiɗ Heɗi. Yi na ñame kañam ci jen, a na namee wa tum ne a yakiɗ Heɗi, laam, a ñamee ɗah, a na corkiɗe corkiɗ Kooh. Yi na ñameeɗi sepet, a na ñamaaɗi'e ne a yakiɗ Heɗi, te a na name nam corkiɗ Kooh ŋ in ci a na ñame.<verse eid="ROM 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 14:7" />Ali ɓo' nga ɓoo pesɗi wuu haf ce, te ali ɓo' kaanɗi wuu haf ce. <verse eid="ROM 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 14:8" />Ɓoo pes ɗah, ɓoo na pese wuu Heɗi ; te ɓoo kaan ɗah, ɓoo na kaane wuu Heɗi. Ɓoo pes, ɓoo kaan, ɓoo wuu Heɗi. <verse eid="ROM 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 14:9" />Laam <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> kaaniɗ, a hulitta, ne a nik Heɗ kaaniɗ ci na pesiɗ ci.<verse eid="ROM 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 14:10" />Mbaa fu yii, wa ye tah fu atte'ee ɓaah fu ? Wala fu yen, wa ye tah fu heefee ɓaah fu ? Inhaat ne ɓoo jen, ɓoo hey tufke ŋ fiki atte'ohaariŋ Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 14:11" />Laam wa fiisuuɗ ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">« Heɗi woo ne : “ Ŋ giñiɗ ŋ kipes kiŋ ngo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">ne ɓooɓi jen hey yo ƴekɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 14:11">te cuuɓ ci jen hey teyɗuke ne a ñam Kooh ! ”<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 45:23">Esayi 45:23</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 14:12" />Ŋ ineem, ya nu nga hey woye ŋ fiki Kooh findi a meeɗ tumoh na kipes kiŋ ɗe.<verse eid="ROM 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kina kafind morom fu sagu kañam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 14:13" />Mbaa ali ɓo' kinaat atte'is morom ce nga ɓoo ; ini ngisoh weɗ ne ɗu marak baahiɗ, ɗu sang degiɗ morom ɗu ini kafndan ɗe po wa kee ɗe hondoha kos. <verse eid="ROM 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 14:14" />Niki ŋ nik ŋ Yeesu Heɗi tahiɗ po wa wooriɗ to ne, ali kañam nikɗi hoolaaɗi ŋ haf wa ; waaye ɓo' amb ne inii usɓiɗ ɗah, wa usɓiɗ nga ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 14:15" />Nik ne kañam ki fu na ñame weɗ na ɓeke morom fu keeñ neɓaaɗi ɗah, fu pesisɗi ŋ waaɗoh. Ɓoyi fu inah ne Kiristaani kaaniɗ wuu ce, kinaat ɗe muuƴiɗ sagu kañam. <verse eid="ROM 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 14:16" />Ali ɗu amb ne inii baahiɗ nga ɗu, wa kinaat tah po ɓo' wiiriis kee raaka woyaah nga ɗu. <verse eid="ROM 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 14:17" />Nguuriŋ-Kooh, wa ñam na an haa, wa kiyurah na jam na sum, taamboh ŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>. <verse eid="ROM 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 14:18" />Laam ɓo' nu na pangkiɗe Kiristaani ŋ ineem ɗah, Kooh hey neɓse nga ɗe, ɓooɓi naw ɗe.<verse eid="ROM 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 14:19" />Mbaa, ɓoo waakaat ini na ɓaye jam te yaa nu nga ɗah waakee ini kaɗɗan morom ce fiki. <verse eid="ROM 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 14:20" />Kañam kinaat tah po ɗu yah pangki Kooh panguk. Wa keeh ne kañam ci jen hooliɗ ; waaye kañam ki fu na ñame tum po ɓo' keen ŋ bakaaɗ ɗah, wa baahɗi. <verse eid="ROM 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 14:21" />Ini ngisoh weɗ ne fu muñ ñam sepet wala an sangara, fu faɗ in ci min kafind ɓaah fu jen.<verse eid="ROM 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 14:22" />Kosi fu kos ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ in ceem, wa nikaat ŋ harmban fu na Kooh. Ɓoyii, a neɓɗiɗ, yi raak hel daliɗ ŋ in ci a amb ne ceɗ baah ! <verse eid="ROM 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 14:23" />Waaye ɓoyi na ñame inaa, te a liiɓsiɗohee nga, a atte'uuɗ tooñ, laam ini a na tume hunɗi na kos, te tumohaaɗ nu hunɗi na kos ɗah, wa bakaaɗ.<verse eid="ROM 14:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ROM 15" />
  <para style="s">Faɗ ini neɓ ɗa, tum ini neɓ morom fu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 15:1" />Ɓoo ɓi ndeng ŋ kosi, ɓoo joyiɗ muñiɗ ɓi kosiŋ ɓa ndengɗi, te ɓoo taambɗuu ini neɓ ɓoo. <verse eid="ROM 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 15:2" />Yaa nu nga ɓoo ɗah, tumaat ini neɓ morom ce, a tumɗe yeem ini baah nga ɗe, wi kaɗɗan ɗe fiki ŋ kosiŋ ɗe. <verse eid="ROM 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 15:3" /><char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> sah tumɗi ini neɓ ɗe ; waaye findi Fiis ci woyoha an : « Ɓasoh ci ɓa na ɓasee ɗa jen, ca miskiɗ to.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 69:10">Sabuur 69:10</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 15:4" />Fiis ci fiisu ɗeɓgaan jen, ca fiisu ne ca jangiɗ ɓoo, ne ɓoo taamboh ŋ muñ na ñaahi Fiis ci na ñaahe ɓoo, ɓoo ooluk in ci na haye. <verse eid="ROM 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 15:5" />Kooh yi Heɗ muñ na ñaahoh onaat ɗu, ɗu nik yino, findi Kiristaani Yeesu waaɗoha, <verse eid="ROM 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 15:6" />ne ɗu hun jen ŋ hooso yino, ɗu yakɗee Koohiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa, yi nam nik Baabiŋ ɗe !<verse eid="ROM 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kiristaani hayiɗ wuu Yawuut ci na ɓi nikɗi Yawuut</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 15:7" />Mbaa, yaa nu nga teyɗukaat morom ce findi Kiristaani teyɗukoh ɗu. Tumohaat ɗaa, ɗu yakiɗ Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 15:8" />Ini ŋ waaɗ woo weɗ ne Kiristaani, a nikiɗ surgaaniŋ Yawuut ci ne a teeɓoh ne Kooh woo keeh, a tumiɗ in ci a gapee caac ca. <verse eid="ROM 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 15:9" />Te a namiɗ on ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ne ɓa min yakiɗ Kooh ŋ yirmi a yirim ɓa, findi wa fiisohu an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">« Ineem weɗ tah ŋ hey ɗa yakɗe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">ŋ ɗooƴ cuuɓ ci</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:9">te ŋ hey ƴeeke tiikiŋ ɗa.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:50">Sabuur 18:50</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 15:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 15:10" />Wa namiɗ fiisu an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">« Ɗu ɓi cuuɓ ci jen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">hunaat na cuuɓiŋ ɗe haf ce,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:10">ɗu sum !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:43">Rohƴiɗi 32:43</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 15:11" />Ɓaatta nga an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">« Ƴeekaat Heɗi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">ɗu ɓi cuuɓ ci jen !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:11">Adinaani jen yakɗaat ɗe !<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 117:1">Sabuur 117:1</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 15:12" />Esayi namiɗ woo ne :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">« Yi rimkoh ŋ Yesay<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yesay </char><char style="ft" closed="false">: a yi baab ɓi Dawuuda.</char></note> hey haye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">a meeɓu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">a adgoh cuuɓ ci ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:12">cuuɓ ci hey dege yaakaariŋ ɓa nga ɗe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 11:10">Esayi 11:10</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 15:13" />Kooh yi Heɗ yaakaar riifɗaat ɗu na sum na jam keeh-keeh ŋ kosi ɗu kos, ne ɗu taamboh ŋ hatiliŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani</char>, ɗu riif na ooluk ŋ in ci na haye.<verse eid="ROM 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ini tah po Pool kaannja woo in ci a woo ŋ kaytii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 15:14" />Ini kaɗ nga ɗu, ɓaah ciŋ ngo, mi deey, wa wooriɗ to ne ɗu baahiɗ po ɗiska baah top, ɗu riifiɗ na inah te ɗu miniɗ ñaahoh ŋ harmban ɗu. <verse eid="ROM 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 15:15" />Waaye ŋ kaañiɗ ƴissuut po ŋ fiisɗiɗ ɗu, ngaŋ kaytii, ɓi woo, ci na hee ɗu yune ŋ in ci ɗu inah. Ŋ kaañiɗa sagu baahohi Kooh baahoh ho, <verse eid="ROM 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 15:16" />ne ŋ nik ŋ pangkiŋ Kiristaani Yeesu wuu ɓi nikɗi Yawuut. Ŋ ineem, ŋ pangkee findi seeƴkiɗoh wuu Kooh ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>, ne ɓi nikɗi Yawuut nik findi seeƴki a teyɗuk. Seeƴkeem, wa hoolɗuuɗ wuu ce taamboh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani.<verse eid="ROM 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 15:17" />Ŋ niki ŋ nik ŋ Kiristaani Yeesu, ŋ miniɗ ndamkoh pangki mi na pangkiɗe Kooh. <verse eid="ROM 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 15:18" />Ŋ kaañɗi woo ali in, ɗal wi Kiristaani haɓiɗ taamboh nga so ne a ɓay ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ngaŋ kerhiɗ Kooh. Weɗ a tum taamboh ŋ woo ciŋ ngo na tumohaaɗ ciŋ ngo, <verse eid="ROM 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 15:19" />taamboh ŋ hatiliŋ firndeeci na keemaan ci na wiŋ <char style="w" lemma="Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani, Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh">Fuuɗsiŋ Kooh</char>. Ini kooɗoh Yerusalem po ŋ Iliri, ŋ yegɗohiɗ Yegɗohiŋ Muci kaɗ ŋ Kiristaani, ŋ ɗisik nu nik. <verse eid="ROM 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 15:20" />Te ini nikiɗee so weɗ ne, ŋ yegɗoh Yegɗohiŋ Muci ŋ ɗisik ci tiikiŋ Kiristaani moosɗi kerhu, ne ŋ taɓahuu ŋ <char style="tl">fondama</char> jaambur. <verse eid="ROM 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 15:21" />Mbaa ini ŋ tum huniɗ na ini Fiis ci woo an :</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">« Ɓi fu inah ne</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">ɓa yegɗuuɗi ini kaɗ nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">ɓa hey hote ;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">ɓa kerheeɗi ini kaɗ nga ɗe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 15:21">ɓa hey inhe.<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 52:15">Esayi 52:15</ref></char></note> »<verse eid="ROM 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pool waaɗiɗ kaɗ Rom na Españ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 15:22" />Ineem weɗ ini hondoh ho waas laayiɗ ne ŋ hay ɗu marke. <verse eid="ROM 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 15:23" />Waaye, ɗiski wa nik ndii, ŋ ɗiindohiɗ pangkiŋ ngo ŋ ɓak cii, te kiis laayiɗ ceɗi, keeñiŋ ngo weɗi ŋ waaɗ hay ɗu marke. <verse eid="ROM 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 15:24" />Ŋ waaɗiɗ kaɗ Españ. Ŋ kaɗee ɗah, ŋ hey taambe ndeem ne ŋ hot ɗu, ŋ neɓsiɗuk ŋ nikiŋ ngo na ɗu ƴissuut, hanaa ɗu hey yo ɓaatɗohe ŋ ɓaaɓiŋ ngo Españ.<verse eid="ROM 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 15:25" />Waaye ɗiski wa nik ndii, mi yii kaɗ Yerusalem, ne ŋ taambkoha ɓo'-Kooh ca nik nga. <verse eid="ROM 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 15:26" />Laam, ɓi Maseduwaan na ɓi Akaay tufkiɗ ne ɓa nangɗoh kopor wuu ɓo'-Kooh ca raakaaɗiica nik ŋ Yerusalem. <verse eid="ROM 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 15:27" />Ɓa tufkiɗ ne ɓa tuma, waaye wa kombot ki ɓa joy ɓa wirind ; laam ini kaɗ ŋ kos, e Yawuut ci ɓayoh raak-raaki, te ɓi nikɗi Yawuut rahsiɗ ɓak nga kotii. Kon, ɓi nikɗi Yawuut ɓeem, ɓa joyiɗ min ɓaatɗoh Yawuut ci na raak-raaki ɓa raak ŋ adinaani.<verse eid="ROM 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ROM 15:28" />Ŋ ƴut eɗoh ɓaatɗoheem moɗoɗ ɗah, ŋ hey kaɗe Españ, ŋ kaɗee ɗah, ŋ taambohan nga ɗu. <verse eid="ROM 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ROM 15:29" />Ŋ inhiɗ ne ŋ hey ɗu marke ɗah, ŋ hey ɗu kome barkeeniŋ Kiristaani findi wa hend jen. <verse eid="ROM 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ROM 15:30" />Waaye, mi yii kiim ɗu ɓaah ciŋ ngo, ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa na waaɗtiɗohi puloh ŋ Fuuɗsi Hoolohngaani ne ɗu taamboh ngaŋ kiim Kooh, ɗu ɓaatɗoh ho ŋ hiñohi, <verse eid="ROM 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ROM 15:31" />ne ŋ muc ɓi sang teyɗuk Kiristaani ŋ Yudee. Kiimɗaat to Kooh po ɓo'-Kooh ci nik ŋ Yerusalem teyɗuk na sum ɓaatɗohi mi na komee ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ROM 15:32" />Ŋ ineem, ŋ hey ɗu hee marke na sum, ne Kooh waaɗa ɗah, te ŋ hey iɗsiɗke ƴissuut ŋ ɗiskiŋ ɗu. <verse eid="ROM 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ROM 15:33" />Kooh, yi na onohe jam nikaat na ɗu jen ! Amiin !<verse eid="ROM 15:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ROM 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ROM 16" />
  <para style="s">Pool kañɗiɗ kosiɗ ci ŋ Rom</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ROM 16:1" />Ambɗaat to baahiɗ Feebe, ɓitɓi ɓaah ɓoo. A ɓaah ŋ ɓi na taambkohe in ciŋ Janguuniŋ Señsare, <verse eid="ROM 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ROM 16:2" />teyɗukaat ɗe baahiɗ ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi findi <char style="w">ɓo'-Kooh ci</char> na tumohee wa ŋ ɗooƴ ɓa. Tufkohaat ɗe ŋ in nu a etoh nga ɗu ɗah, laam a namiɗ tufkoh ɓo' laayiɗ, po mi sah.<verse eid="ROM 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ROM 16:3" />Kañɗiɗaat to Piriska na Akilaas, huntoh ciŋ ngo ŋ pangki ɓoo na pangkiɗe <char style="w" lemma="Kiristaa">Kiristaani</char> Yeesu. <verse eid="ROM 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ROM 16:4" />Ɓeɗ ɓeem, ɓa sangeeɗi sah kaan ne ɓa muciɗ kiñin kiŋ ngo. A mi dong na corkiɗee ɓa haa, Janguuciŋ ɓi nikɗi Yawuut jen ɓa ɗii corkiɗ ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ROM 16:5" />Namaat to kañɗiɗ ɓooɓi na cohe ŋ Janguuni nik ŋ kahan ɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ROM 16:5">Kañɗiɗaat to Epaynet, nawleeso yi ŋ keeñkoh, a yi koc kos Kiristaani ŋ kur caŋ Asi. <verse eid="ROM 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ROM 16:6" />Kañɗiɗaat to Mari, pangki a pangkiɗ ɗu, wa miskiɗ lool.<verse eid="ROM 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ROM 16:7" />Kañɗiɗaat to Andoronikos na Juniya, ɓaah ciŋ ngo Yawuut ci taƴsee na so ; ɓa <char style="w"><char style="tl">Apootar</char></char> nawuuɗ, ɓeɗ koc co sah nik ŋ Kiristaani.<verse eid="ROM 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ROM 16:8" />Kañɗiɗaat to Ampilyatus, nawleeso yi ŋ keeñkoh ŋ niki ɓoo nik ŋ Heɗi. <verse eid="ROM 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ROM 16:9" />Ɗu kañɗiɗ to Irbeŋ, huntohiŋ ɓoo ŋ pangki ɓoo na pangkiɗe Kiristaani, ɗu nam mbo kañɗiɗ Estakis, nawleeso yi ŋ keeñkoh. <verse eid="ROM 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ROM 16:10" />Ɗu kañɗiɗ to Apelees, yi teeɓoh ŋoɗi a ŋoɗ ŋ Kiristaani. Ɗu kañɗiɗ to ɓi kahan Aristobil. <verse eid="ROM 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ROM 16:11" />Ɗu kañɗiɗ to ɓaah ho Yawuut Herojoon. Ɗu kañɗiɗ to ɓi kahan Narsis ɓi nik ŋ Heɗi.<verse eid="ROM 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ROM 16:12" />Kañɗiɗaat to Tirifeen na Tirifoos, ɓa ɓitiɓ ci na pangkiɗe Heɗi panguk miskiɗ. Ɗu kañɗiɗ to Persid, nawleeso yi ŋ keeñkoh, pangki ɓitɓeem na pangkiɗe Heɗi, wa miskootiɗ. <verse eid="ROM 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ROM 16:13" />Ɗu kañɗiɗ to Rufus, yeem e Heɗi tan ɗe, kañɗiɗaat to yaay ɓa, a nam nik yaay nga so.<verse eid="ROM 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ROM 16:14" />Kañɗiɗaat to Aseŋkirit na Felegon na Hermes na Patrobas na Hermas, na ɓaah ciŋ ɓoo kosiɗ ci nik na ɓa. <verse eid="ROM 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ROM 16:15" />Ɗu kañɗiɗ to Filolog na Juliya, na Neere na taambɗoh ce ɓitiɓ, na Olimpas na ɓo'-Kooh ci nik na ɓa jen.<verse eid="ROM 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ROM 16:16" />Kañɗohaat ŋ harmban ɗu, ɗu morgiɗkohee, wa hun na keeñ hooliɗ. Janguuciŋ Kiristaani jen ca ɗii kañiɗ ɗu.<verse eid="ROM 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dengoh ci mirndoh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ROM 16:17" />Mi yii ñaah ɗu ɓaah ciŋ ngo, wortukaat ɓi na ɓekee ɗu saɓsukoh, ɓa muuƴɗee ɗu na jangɗoh ci ɗaloh na ci ɗu rahas. Usaat ɓa ! <verse eid="ROM 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ROM 16:18" />Ɓooɓi mand ɗaa, ɓa na ñaamke Heɗ ɓoo Kiristaani haa, ɓa na ñaamke rook ciŋ ɓa. Ɓa na woye woo neɓiɗ, ɓa woyee in baahiɗ ŋ ɓooɓi po ɓa ñaañoh yunkaaɗiici.<verse eid="ROM 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ROM 16:19" />Ɗu nak, ɓooɓi jen inhiɗ kerhiɗi ɗu kerhiɗ Heɗi ; ŋ neɓuuɗ ŋ ini kaɗ nga ɗu, waaye ŋ waaɗiɗ ne ɗu inhisoh ini kaɗ ŋ baahiɗ te ɗu hool ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ baahaaɗi. <verse eid="ROM 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ROM 16:20" />Kooh yi na onohe jam hey pooksohe Seytaani maañaaɗi ŋ ooɓ kot ciŋ ɗu. Baahohiŋ Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu nikaat na ɗu.<verse eid="ROM 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Askohi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ROM 16:21" />Timoote, huntohiŋ ngo ngaŋ pangki, yii kañiɗ ɗu, a yi na ɓaah ciŋ ngo Yawuut ci Lusiyus, Yasoon na Sosipateer. <verse eid="ROM 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ROM 16:22" />Mi yi Tertiyus, yi fiis in ci Pool woo ŋ kaytii jen, mi yii kañiɗ ɗu ŋ tiikiŋ Heɗi. <verse eid="ROM 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ROM 16:23" />Gayus yii kañiɗ ɗu. Mi yi Pool, ŋ dal ŋ kahan ce, ɓi Janguuni jen na name coh nga. Erasta, yi na taambkohe raak-raakiŋ kur-taahii, a yii kañiɗ ɗu, a yi na ɓaah ɓoo Kuwartus. [<verse eid="ROM 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ROM 16:24" />]<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ngaŋ Fiis ci maañiɗ ci, cum raak ayaanii : "Heɗ ɓoo Yeesu Kiristaa baahohaat ɗu jen ! Amiin !" Waaye Fiis ci uup woor ngaŋ ci maañiɗ ci ris woti raakɗi woo keem.</char></note><verse eid="ROM 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kooh, a yi yakɗaah</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ROM 16:25" />A yakɗaah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:25">Kooh yi min ndengiɗ kosiŋ ɗu !</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:25">Ineem weɗ woyu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:25">ŋ <char style="w">Yegɗohiŋ Muci</char>,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:25">wi mi na yegɗohe</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:25">ŋ ini kaɗ ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:25">Te wa hun na ini teeɓohu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:25">wi ɗasɗasse,<verse eid="ROM 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ROM 16:26" />waaye ɗiski wa nik,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:26">wa puliɗ jahran,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:26">te cuuɓ ci jen inhiɗuuɗa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:26">taamboh ŋ Fiis ciŋ woosuuɗ ci.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:26">E Kooh yi genan gen,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:26">a yi nakohee ineem,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:26">ne cuuɓ ci jen min ɗe kerhiɗ</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:26">taamboh ŋ kos.<verse eid="ROM 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ROM 16:27" />Kooheem, a yi dong</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:27">raak liiɓohaaɗ moɗiɗ,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:27">te a yi yakɗaah po faw</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:27">taamboh ŋ Yeesu Kiristaa !</para>
  <para style="b" vid="ROM 16:27" />
  <para style="q" vid="ROM 16:27">Amiin !<verse eid="ROM 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <chapter eid="ROM 16" />
</usx>